(8869, 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'page', '{\"name\":\"D\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Page\\\\Models\\\\Page\",\"slug\":\"dich-vu\",\"slug_id\":\"42\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":null,\"content_mode\":\"blocks\",\"content\":\"<shortcode>[feature-area title=\\\"H\\u1ed9i Ngh\\u1ecb\\\" subtitle=\\\"Conference &amp; Meeting\\\" description=\\\"T\\u1ecda l\\u1ea1c t\\u1ea1i t\\u1ea7ng 3, Ruby Ballroom l\\u00e0 l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn l\\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng cho ti\\u1ec7c c\\u01b0\\u1edbi, h\\u1ed9i ngh\\u1ecb v\\u00e0 s\\u1ef1 ki\\u1ec7n t\\u1ea1i V\\u0169ng T\\u00e0u v\\u1edbi s\\u1ee9c ch\\u1ee9a 120 \\u2013 150 kh\\u00e1ch. Kh\\u00f4ng gian \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i, tinh t\\u1ebf, k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng \\u00e2m thanh \\u2013 \\u00e1nh s\\u00e1ng chu\\u1ea9n 3 sao v\\u00e0 t\\u1ea7m nh\\u00ecn h\\u01b0\\u1edbng bi\\u1ec3n \\u1ea5n t\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng. Th\\u1ef1c \\u0111\\u01a1n \\u00c1 \\u2013 \\u00c2u \\u0111a d\\u1ea1ng, d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 chuy\\u00ean nghi\\u1ec7p, ch\\u1ec9n chu t\\u1eebng chi ti\\u1ebft c\\u00f9ng kh\\u00f4ng gian linh ho\\u1ea1t cho nhi\\u1ec1u concept s\\u1ef1 ki\\u1ec7n.\\\" image=\\\"photo-1519167758481-83f550bb49b3autoformatfitc.jpg\\\" button_primary_label=\\\"T\\u00ccM HI\\u1ec2U TH\\u00caM\\\" button_primary_url=\\\"\\/hoi-nghi\\\"][\\/feature-area]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[feature-area data-vb-id=\\\"shortcode_1785831862_1\\\" id=\\\"shortcode_1774518909_1\\\" title=\\\"H\\u1ed3 B\\u01a1i V\\u00f4 C\\u1ef1c &amp; Ruby Ocean Bar\\\" subtitle=\\\"Infinity Pool &amp; Ruby Ocean Bar\\\" description=\\\"T\\u1ecda l\\u1ea1c t\\u1ea1i t\\u1ea7ng 7 kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n Ruby 68, h\\u1ed3 b\\u01a1i v\\u00f4 c\\u1ef1c g\\u00e2y \\u1ea5n t\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng v\\u1edbi thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf k\\u00ednh trong su\\u1ed1t \\u0111\\u1ed9c \\u0111\\u00e1o, m\\u1edf ra t\\u1ea7m nh\\u00ecn to\\u00e0n c\\u1ea3nh bi\\u1ec3n B\\u00e3i Sau V\\u0169ng T\\u00e0u \\u0111\\u1ea7y ngo\\u1ea1n m\\u1ee5c. Th\\u1ea3 m\\u00ecnh trong l\\u00e0n n\\u01b0\\u1edbc xanh m\\u00e1t, t\\u1eadn h\\u01b0\\u1edfng \\u00e1nh n\\u1eafng \\u1ea5m \\u00e1p v\\u00e0 nh\\u00e2m nhi cocktail t\\u1ea1i Ruby Ocean Bar, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m th\\u01b0 gi\\u00e3n kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ecf l\\u1ee1 khi l\\u01b0u tr\\u00fa t\\u1ea1i kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n.\\\" image=\\\"dinning\\/blue-ocean-bar\\/4.png\\\" background_image=\\\"services\\/swimming-pool-256.png\\\" button_primary_label=\\\"T\\u00ccM HI\\u1ec2U TH\\u00caM\\\" button_primary_url=\\\"\\/ruby-ocean-bar\\\"][\\/feature-area]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[feature-area title=\\\"Gym Center\\\" description=\\\"T\\u1ecda l\\u1ea1c t\\u1ea1i t\\u1ea7ng 6 kh\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea1n Ruby 68, Gym Center mang \\u0111\\u1ebfn kh\\u00f4ng gian luy\\u1ec7n t\\u1eadp hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i v\\u1edbi t\\u1ea7m nh\\u00ecn h\\u01b0\\u1edbng bi\\u1ec3n B\\u00e3i Sau v\\u00e0 th\\u00e0nh ph\\u1ed1, ng\\u1eadp tr\\u00e0n \\u00e1nh s\\u00e1ng t\\u1ef1 nhi\\u00ean. Kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u1ec9 l\\u00e0 n\\u01a1i r\\u00e8n luy\\u1ec7n th\\u1ec3 l\\u1ef1c, m\\u1ed7i bu\\u1ed5i t\\u1eadp t\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u00e2y c\\u00f2n l\\u00e0 tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m th\\u01b0 gi\\u00e3n \\u0111\\u1ea7y c\\u1ea3m h\\u1ee9ng trong kh\\u00f4ng gian r\\u1ed9ng r\\u00e3i, tinh t\\u1ebf. Trang b\\u1ecb h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng m\\u00e1y m\\u00f3c \\u0111\\u1ea1t chu\\u1ea9n qu\\u1ed1c t\\u1ebf, ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p t\\u1eeb c\\u00e1c b\\u00e0i t\\u1eadp nh\\u1eb9 nh\\u00e0ng \\u0111\\u1ebfn chuy\\u00ean nghi\\u1ec7p\\\" image=\\\"photo-1571902943202-507ec2618e8fautoformatfitc-1.jpg\\\" button_primary_label=\\\"T\\u00ccM HI\\u1ec2U TH\\u00caM\\\" button_primary_url=\\\"\\/gym-center\\\"][\\/feature-area]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[feature-area title=\\\"Ruby Spa\\\" description=\\\"C\\u00e1c li\\u1ec7u tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf tinh t\\u1ebf, k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p gi\\u1eefa k\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt tr\\u1ecb li\\u1ec7u chuy\\u00ean s\\u00e2u v\\u00e0 nguy\\u00ean li\\u1ec7u cao c\\u1ea5p, mang \\u0111\\u1ebfn tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m th\\u01b0 gi\\u00e3n to\\u00e0n di\\u1ec7n cho c\\u01a1 th\\u1ec3 v\\u00e0 t\\u00e2m tr\\u00ed. T\\u1eeb massage th\\u01b0 gi\\u00e3n, ch\\u0103m s\\u00f3c da \\u0111\\u1ebfn c\\u00e1c li\\u1ec7u ph\\u00e1p ph\\u1ee5c h\\u1ed3i, m\\u1ed7i h\\u00e0nh tr\\u00ecnh t\\u1ea1i Ruby Spa \\u0111\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ch\\u0103m ch\\u00fat t\\u1ec9 m\\u1ec9, gi\\u00fap b\\u1ea1n t\\u1eadn h\\u01b0\\u1edfng tr\\u1ecdn v\\u1eb9n s\\u1ef1 an y\\u00ean trong chu\\u1ea9n m\\u1ef1c d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 3 sao.\\\" image=\\\"photo-1540555700478-4be289fbecefautoformatfitc.jpg\\\" button_primary_label=\\\"T\\u00ccM HI\\u1ec2U TH\\u00caM\\\" button_primary_url=\\\"\\/ruby-spa\\\"][\\/feature-area]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[feature-area title=\\\"Ruby Sky Lounge\\\" description=\\\"Kh\\u00f4ng gian rooftop hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i, \\u00e2m nh\\u1ea1c s\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u1ed9ng c\\u00f9ng th\\u1ef1c \\u0111\\u01a1n cocktail s\\u00e1ng t\\u1ea1o t\\u1ea1o n\\u00ean \\u0111i\\u1ec3m h\\u1eb9n l\\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng cho nh\\u1eefng bu\\u1ed5i t\\u1ed1i \\u0111\\u1ea7y c\\u1ea3m h\\u1ee9ng. D\\u00f9 l\\u00e0 th\\u01b0 gi\\u00e3n nh\\u1eb9 nh\\u00e0ng hay h\\u00f2a m\\u00ecnh v\\u00e0o nh\\u1ecbp s\\u1ed1ng v\\u1ec1 \\u0111\\u00eam, Ruby Sky Lounge lu\\u00f4n l\\u00e0 n\\u01a1i l\\u01b0u gi\\u1eef nh\\u1eefng kho\\u1ea3nh kh\\u1eafc \\u0111\\u00e1ng nh\\u1edb gi\\u1eefa b\\u1ea7u tr\\u1eddi v\\u00e0 bi\\u1ec3n c\\u1ea3.\\\" image=\\\"photo-1470337458703-46ad1756a187autoformatfitc.jpg\\\" button_primary_label=\\\"T\\u00ccM HI\\u1ec2U TH\\u00caM\\\" button_primary_url=\\\"\\/ruby-sky-lounge\\\"][\\/feature-area]<\\/shortcode>\",\"custom_html\":null,\"gallery\":null,\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"submitter\":\"apply\",\"language\":\"vi\",\"status\":\"published\",\"template\":\"full-width\",\"breadcrumb\":\"1\",\"breadcrumb_background\":\"untitled-design-1-1.png\",\"image\":null}', 'updated', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '171.243.63.133', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 6, 'Dịch vụ', 'primary', '2026-08-04 08:26:18', '2026-08-04 08:26:18'),
(8870, 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '', '{\"name\":\"Services\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Page\\\\Models\\\\Page\",\"slug\":\"dich-vu\",\"slug_id\":\"42\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":null,\"content_mode\":\"blocks\",\"content\":\"<shortcode>[feature-area title=\\\"Conference\\\" subtitle=\\\"Conference &amp; Meeting\\\" description=\\\"Located on the 3rd floor, Ruby Ballroom is the quintessential choice for weddings, conferences, and events in V\\u0169ng T\\u00e0u, accommodating 120 \\u2013 150 guests. The space is designed with modern sophistication, featuring a 3-star standard sound and lighting system and an impressive sea-facing panoramic view. Offering a diverse Asian-European menu, professional service, meticulous attention to detail, and a versatile setting adaptable to various event concepts.\\\" image=\\\"photo-1519167758481-83f550bb49b3autoformatfitc-2.jpg\\\" button_primary_label=\\\"LEARN MORE\\\" button_primary_url=\\\"\\/en\\/hoi-nghi\\\"][\\/feature-area]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[feature-area title=\\\"Infinity Pool &amp; Ruby Ocean Bar\\\" subtitle=\\\"Infinity Pool &amp; Ruby Ocean Bar\\\" description=\\\"Situated on the 7th floor of Ruby 68 Hotel, the infinity pool captivates with its unique transparent glass design, unveiling a breathtaking panoramic vista of Back Beach Vung Tau. Immerse yourself in the cool, pristine waters, bask in the warm sunlight, and savor exquisite cocktails at Ruby Ocean Bar\\u2014an unmissable relaxation experience during your stay.\\\" image=\\\"dinning\\/blue-ocean-bar\\/4.png\\\" button_primary_label=\\\"LEARN MORE\\\" button_primary_url=\\\"\\/en\\/ruby-ocean-bar\\\"][\\/feature-area]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[feature-area title=\\\"Gym Center\\\" description=\\\"Perched on the 6th floor of Ruby 68 Hotel, the Gym Center presents a modern workout environment with panoramic views of Back Beach Vung Tau and the city, bathed in natural light. More than a fitness space, each session here is an inspiring relaxation experience within a spacious, refined setting. Equipped with internationally standard machinery, it caters to all levels from gentle exercises to professional training.\\\" image=\\\"photo-1571902943202-507ec2618e8fautoformatfitc-1.jpg\\\" button_primary_label=\\\"LEARN MORE\\\" button_primary_url=\\\"\\/en\\/gym-center\\\"][\\/feature-area]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[feature-area title=\\\"Ruby Spa\\\" description=\\\"Treatments are exquisitely crafted, blending advanced therapeutic techniques with premium ingredients to deliver a holistic relaxation experience for body and mind. From soothing massages and skincare to restorative therapies, every journey at Ruby Spa is meticulously curated to ensure you fully embrace tranquility within the 3-star service excellence.\\\" image=\\\"photo-1540555700478-4be289fbecefautoformatfitc.jpg\\\" button_primary_label=\\\"LEARN MORE\\\" button_primary_url=\\\"\\/en\\/ruby-spa\\\"][\\/feature-area]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[feature-area title=\\\"Ruby Sky Lounge\\\" description=\\\"A contemporary rooftop haven where vibrant music and innovative cocktail menus create the perfect setting for inspired evenings. Whether seeking gentle relaxation or immersing in the nightlife rhythm, Ruby Sky Lounge is the place to capture unforgettable moments between the sky and the sea.\\\" image=\\\"photo-1470337458703-46ad1756a187autoformatfitc.jpg\\\" button_primary_label=\\\"LEARN MORE\\\" button_primary_url=\\\"\\/en\\/ruby-sky-lounge\\\"][\\/feature-area]<\\/shortcode>\",\"custom_html\":null,\"form\":\"Botble\\\\Page\\\\Forms\\\\PageForm\",\"gallery\":null,\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"submitter\":\"apply\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"ref_lang\":\"en_US\"}', 'updated', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '171.243.63.133', 3, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 6, 'Services', 'primary', '2026-08-04 08:28:54', '2026-08-04 08:28:54'),
