(5, 'Duplex Golf', '1,500m | 21 min. Walk', NULL, '<div class=\"nearby-attractions\">\n    <div class=\"content-box\">\n        <h2>Explore the Nearby Attractions</h2>\n        <p>Indulge in the beauty and flavors of the local area, where breathtaking sights and delightful cuisine await you. Allow us to present an overview of the splendid attractions you can experience during your stay.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"two-column\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n                <div class=\"image-column col-xl-6 col-lg-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"http://localhost/storage/places/01.jpg\" alt=\"RioRelax\"></figure>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-column col-xl-6 col-lg-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"http://localhost/storage/places/02.jpg\" alt=\"RioRelax\"></figure>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <h3>Relax at the Beach</h3>\n\n        <p>Unwind and soak in the serenity of the pristine beach just steps away from our hotel. The soft sand, gentle waves, and stunning horizon create an idyllic setting for you to rejuvenate your senses. Whether you\'re lounging under the sun or taking a leisurely stroll, the beach offers a tranquil escape from the daily hustle and bustle.</p>\n\n        <h3>Dine at the Finest Restaurant</h3>\n\n        <p>Embark on a culinary journey at the finest local restaurant that is a true gem in our neighborhood. Savor a diverse array of mouthwatering dishes meticulously crafted by skilled chefs. From delectable appetizers to sumptuous main courses and decadent desserts, every bite is a celebration of flavor and creativity. The cozy ambiance and attentive service enhance the overall dining experience.</p>\n\n        <p>Whether you\'re a food enthusiast or a nature lover, our hotel\'s location provides you with the best of both worlds. Immerse yourself in the captivating beauty of the beach and treat your taste buds to an unforgettable dining experience. Your stay with us is bound to be filled with wonderful memories that you\'ll cherish for years to come.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"two-column\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n                <div class=\"image-column col-xl-12 col-lg-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"http://localhost/storage/places/03.jpg\" alt=\"RioRelax\"></figure>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p>For those seeking more adventure, a nearby scenic spot offers breathtaking views that will leave you in awe. The harmonious blend of nature\'s grandeur and artistic beauty makes this spot a perfect place to capture stunning photographs and create lasting memories.</p>\n\n        <p>Immerse yourself in the local culture, indulge in the delights of the area, and let your senses guide you as you explore the wonders just beyond our doorstep.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506929562872-bb421503ef21?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80', 'published', '2025-06-10 10:38:11', '2025-06-10 10:38:11'),
(6, 'Luxury Restaurant', '1,500m | 21 min. Walk', NULL, '<div class=\"nearby-attractions\">\n    <div class=\"content-box\">\n        <h2>Explore the Nearby Attractions</h2>\n        <p>Indulge in the beauty and flavors of the local area, where breathtaking sights and delightful cuisine await you. Allow us to present an overview of the splendid attractions you can experience during your stay.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"two-column\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n                <div class=\"image-column col-xl-6 col-lg-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"http://localhost/storage/places/01.jpg\" alt=\"RioRelax\"></figure>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-column col-xl-6 col-lg-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"http://localhost/storage/places/02.jpg\" alt=\"RioRelax\"></figure>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <h3>Relax at the Beach</h3>\n\n        <p>Unwind and soak in the serenity of the pristine beach just steps away from our hotel. The soft sand, gentle waves, and stunning horizon create an idyllic setting for you to rejuvenate your senses. Whether you\'re lounging under the sun or taking a leisurely stroll, the beach offers a tranquil escape from the daily hustle and bustle.</p>\n\n        <h3>Dine at the Finest Restaurant</h3>\n\n        <p>Embark on a culinary journey at the finest local restaurant that is a true gem in our neighborhood. Savor a diverse array of mouthwatering dishes meticulously crafted by skilled chefs. From delectable appetizers to sumptuous main courses and decadent desserts, every bite is a celebration of flavor and creativity. The cozy ambiance and attentive service enhance the overall dining experience.</p>\n\n        <p>Whether you\'re a food enthusiast or a nature lover, our hotel\'s location provides you with the best of both worlds. Immerse yourself in the captivating beauty of the beach and treat your taste buds to an unforgettable dining experience. Your stay with us is bound to be filled with wonderful memories that you\'ll cherish for years to come.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"two-column\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n                <div class=\"image-column col-xl-12 col-lg-12 col-md-12\">\n                    <figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"http://localhost/storage/places/03.jpg\" alt=\"RioRelax\"></figure>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p>For those seeking more adventure, a nearby scenic spot offers breathtaking views that will leave you in awe. The harmonious blend of nature\'s grandeur and artistic beauty makes this spot a perfect place to capture stunning photographs and create lasting memories.</p>\n\n        <p>Immerse yourself in the local culture, indulge in the delights of the area, and let your senses guide you as you explore the wonders just beyond our doorstep.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583417319070-4a69db38a482?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80', 'published', '2025-06-10 10:38:11', '2025-06-10 10:38:11');
INSERT INTO `ht_products_translations` (`lang_code`, `ht_products_id`, `name`, `description`, `content`, `image`, `images`) VALUES
('en_US', 1, 'Afternoon Tea – Luxurious Afternoon Tea at Ruby 68 Hotel Vũng Tàu Description', 'Indulge in a luxurious afternoon tea set with exquisite pastries and premium tea in a relaxing atmosphere, ideal for gentle gatherings.', '<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"877\"><strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"576\">Afternoon Tea at Ruby 68 Hotel Vũng Tàu</strong> offers an elegant afternoon tea experience for those who appreciate a luxurious, serene, and refined atmosphere. With a harmonious combination of fragrant tea, delicate pastries, light savory dishes, and beautiful presentation, it is the ideal choice to enjoy a relaxing afternoon in the heart of Vũng Tàu.</p><p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1196\">The afternoon tea sets are designed for <strong data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"932\">02 guests</strong>, suitable for couples, groups of friends, small families, or hotel guests seeking a private, gentle, and emotionally enriching time. Each dish is meticulously prepared, complemented by the warm aroma of tea, providing an experience that is both luxurious and intimate.</p><p data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1582\">The Afternoon Tea menu currently features options such as <strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1284\">Velvet Elegance</strong> priced at <strong data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1321\">580,000 VNĐ/02 guests</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1366\">Whispering Petals</strong> priced at <strong data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1403\">480,000 VNĐ/02 guests</strong>. Each set has its own unique style, perfect for enjoying during romantic dates, intimate gatherings, or simply treating oneself to a truly relaxing afternoon.</p><p data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1795\">If you are looking for a beautiful <strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1650\">afternoon tea spot in Vũng Tàu</strong>, with a luxurious atmosphere, exquisite cuisine, and hotel-standard service, <strong data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1765\">Afternoon Tea at Ruby 68 Hotel</strong> is a must-try experience.</p><p data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1825\"><strong data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1825\">Afternoon tea package information:</strong></p><p data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"2075\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1851\">Velvet Elegance Package:</strong> 580,000 VNĐ / 02 guests<br><strong data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1903\">Whispering Petals Package:</strong> 480,000 VNĐ / 02 guests<br><strong data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1942\">Location: </strong>8th Floor, Ruby 68 Hotel, 6 Thùy Vân, Vũng Tàu<br><strong data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2008\">Suitable for:</strong> Dates, friend gatherings, family, hotel guests, and local visitors</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1920/1080;\" src=\"/storage/tv-led-hp-hour.png\" alt=\"tv-led-hp-hour.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'trachieumoi.png', '[null,\"8-3.png\",\"7-3.png\",\"6-5.png\",\"5-6.png\"]'),
('en_US', 2, 'Aroma Massage 90 Minutes – Premium Relaxation at Hotel Spa', 'Experience a 90-minute aroma massage combined with hot stones and essential oils for deep relaxation, stress relief, and effective energy restoration.', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\"><p>Indulge in the spa services at Ruby 68 Hotel, a self-care journey with 3-star standards that you simply must not miss.</p><p>The tranquil, luxurious space combined with the gentle aroma of essential oils takes you into a state of absolute relaxation from the very first moments. Each treatment is performed by a team of professional technicians, with each refined movement helping to relieve stress, restore energy, and nourish the skin from deep within.</p><p>This is not just a spa session, but a comprehensive rejuvenation experience — where the body is pampered and the mind is healed, bringing a perfect sense of balance amidst the coastal city of Vũng Tàu.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><p><img src=\"/storage/17-1.png\" alt=\"17-1\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></section><div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\">&nbsp;</div><h2 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><span><strong>Massage Packages at the Spa</strong></span></h2><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><li><strong>Combo 1:</strong> Massage + Aroma 60 minutes</li><li><strong>Combo 2:</strong> Massage + Aroma + Deep Tissue 60 minutes</li><li><strong>Combo 3:</strong> Massage + Hot Stone + Aroma 90 minutes</li><li><strong>Combo 4:</strong> Massage + Hot Stone + Deep Tissue 90 minutes</li><li><strong>Pedicure:</strong> Foot massage 60 minutes + foot soak</li></ul><hr><h2 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><span><strong>Benefits of Using the Service</strong></span></h2><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><li>Reduces stress and fatigue</li><li>Relaxes muscles, improves circulation</li><li>Supports sleep and restores energy</li></ul><hr><h2 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><span><strong>Schedule Your Experience</strong></span></h2><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\">Contact us now to experience the <strong>90-minute aroma massage</strong> in a tranquil, luxurious spa setting.</p>', NULL, NULL),
('en_US', 3, 'Premium Relaxation Sauna – Experience Steam & Spa at the Hotel', 'The sauna service (steam) is the perfect choice to detoxify the body, reduce stress, and restore energy. The modern space with a spacious view offers a complete relaxation experience.', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\"><p>The sauna experience at Ruby 68 Hotel is the epitome of 3-star relaxation that you should not miss when visiting the coastal city.</p><p>The warm, refined space with gentle wood aromas quickly separates you from all the noise, bringing your body and mind into a state of absolute relaxation. The soothing steam gently spreads, helping to detoxify the body, calming each sense, and rejuvenating your inner energy.</p><p>In just a short time, you will clearly feel a complete recovery — a premium, sophisticated experience worthy of enjoyment when visiting Vũng Tàu.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\">&nbsp;</div><p><img src=\"/storage/20-2.png\" alt=\"20-2\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p><span><strong>Sauna Packages</strong></span></p><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><span><strong>Relax Combo – 250,000 VND/person</strong></span></h3><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><li>120 minutes of sauna steam</li><li>01 complimentary drink (beer / soft drink / coffee)</li><li>Use of towels, locker, and shower room</li></ul><hr><h3 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><span><strong>Retreat Combo – 900,000 VND/person</strong></span></h3><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><li>Unlimited use of the infinity pool</li><li>120 minutes of sauna steam</li><li>01 body massage for 60 minutes</li><li>01 complimentary drink</li><li>Use of relaxation chairs, towels, locker, and shower room</li></ul><hr><h2 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><span><strong>Benefits of Sauna</strong></span></h2><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><li>Detoxifies the body, cleanses the skin</li><li>Reduces stress, relaxes the mind</li><li>Alleviates muscle pain and improves circulation</li><li>Supports rapid energy recovery</li></ul><hr><h2 style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\"><span><strong>Schedule Your Experience</strong></span></h2><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\">Contact us now to experience the service <strong>premium sauna</strong> in a luxurious space, ideal for moments of relaxation.</p>', NULL, NULL),
('en_US', 4, 'Test', 'Test1', '<p>qưeqwdasd</p>', NULL, NULL),
('en_US', 5, '3 Days 2 Nights Holiday Combo', 'Enjoy a 3-day 2-night luxury stay at Ruby 68 Hotel – a 3-star hotel boasting spectacular views of Back Beach Vung Tau.\r\nThe Holiday Package offers a complete relaxation experience with 2 nights of luxurious accommodation, a relaxing foot massage session for 2 guests, and the privilege of a room upgrade for your next stay. All designed for you to unwind, recharge, and enjoy', '<h2><span><strong>HOLIDAY PACKAGE – 3 DAYS 2 NIGHTS VACATION AT RUBY 68</strong></span></h2><h3>Experience 3-star relaxation in Back Beach Vung Tau – no holiday surcharge</h3><p>A perfect vacation is not just a place to stay, but a feeling of enjoying every moment.</p><p>With <strong>Holiday Package 3 days 2 nights</strong>, Ruby 68 Hotel offers you a premium holiday journey, where every detail is carefully crafted to international 3-star hotel standards.<img src=\"/storage/boton-blue-gallery/rooms/651080001-1580439617421471-8512352631803196385-n.jpg\" alt=\"651080001_1580439617421471_8512352631803196385_n\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1536/1024;\" src=\"/storage/chatgpt-image-mar-30-2026-04-21-41-pm.png\" alt=\"chatgpt-image-mar-30-2026-04-21-41-pm.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\"></figure><h2><span><strong>PACKAGE INFORMATION</strong></span></h2><ul><li><strong>Stay duration:</strong> 25/04/2026 – 03/05/2026</li><li><strong>Special offer:</strong> No holiday surcharge when booking in advance <strong>20/04/2026</strong></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span><strong>PACKAGE PRICE</strong></span></h2><h3><span><strong>From 1.5XX,000 VND / guest</strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span><strong>BENEFITS INCLUDED</strong></span></h2><p>✔️ 02 nights stay at a 3-star standard hotel<br>✔️ 01 session <strong>relaxing foot massage</strong> for 02 guests<br>✔️ <strong>Room upgrade for your next stay</strong> (subject to room availability)</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1024/680;\" src=\"/storage/2-bqim.jpg\" alt=\"2-bqim.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"680\"></figure><h2><span><strong>AN EXPERIENCE NOT TO MISS</strong></span></h2><p>At Ruby 68, your vacation is more than just a room:</p><ul><li>Immerse yourself in the <strong>7th-floor infinity pool</strong> with panoramic views of Back Beach Vung Tau</li><li>Enjoy cocktails at the <strong>Ruby Ocean Bar</strong> amidst the sea and sky ambiance</li><li>Relax at the <strong>premium Sauna &amp; Jacuzzi area</strong></li><li>Watch the sunset and city lights at <strong>Ruby Sky Lounge on the 9th floor</strong></li></ul><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:2212/1356;\" src=\"/storage/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"2212\" height=\"1356\"></figure><h2><span><strong>WHY CHOOSE THE HOLIDAY PACKAGE</strong></span></h2><ul><li>No holiday surcharge – cost-effective while maintaining 5★ standards</li><li>All-inclusive holiday experience, no complicated planning needed</li><li>Suitable for couples, small families, or guests wanting a short getaway</li><li>Greater value compared to booking individual rooms</li></ul>', NULL, NULL),
('en_US', 6, '4 Days 3 Nights Holiday Package', 'Enjoy a complete long stay at Ruby 68 Hotel with the 4 Days 3 Nights Holiday Package – the ideal choice to explore Vũng Tàu in a slower and more refined way.\r\nThe package includes 3 nights at a 3-star standard hotel, offering a luxurious resort space with stunning bay views. Additionally, guests will enjoy meals for 2 and cocktails', '<h3>Stay longer – enjoy more fully at Ruby 68</h3><p>Some trips shouldn’t be rushed.</p><p>With the 4 Days 3 Nights Holiday Package, Ruby 68 Hotel offers a true vacation – where you have enough time to enjoy, relax, and fully experience the beauty of Vũng Tàu in your own way.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1536/1024;\" src=\"/storage/chatgpt-image-mar-30-2026-04-09-57-pm.png\" alt=\"chatgpt-image-mar-30-2026-04-09-57-pm.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\"></figure><hr><h2><span><strong>COMPLETE EXPERIENCE</strong></span></h2><p>3 nights stay at a 3-star hotel with stunning bay views – where every morning begins with a sunrise over the sea, and every afternoon is a moment of relaxation at the 7th-floor infinity pool.</p><p>Not only limited to the resort space, the journey is also enhanced with:<br>✨ Meals for 2 guests<br>✨ Welcome cocktail<br>✨ Premium sauna &amp; jacuzzi experience</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1920/1080;\" src=\"/storage/z7520085282783-a452765683adf8462342b9fc4c994b96.jpg\" alt=\"z7520085282783-a452765683adf8462342b9fc4c994b96.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></figure><h2><span><strong>UNRUSHED VACATION</strong></span></h2><p>One more night – means more time to:</p><ul><li>Immerse yourself in the infinity pool water</li><li>Sip cocktails by the sea</li><li>Explore the city and return to a quiet, private space</li></ul><p>No need for a packed schedule, just enjoy every moment the way you want.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1146/2048;\" src=\"/storage/513488657-9803182413125103-5356792191793818422-n.jpg\" alt=\"513488657-9803182413125103-5356792191793818422-n.jpg\" width=\"1146\" height=\"2048\"></figure><h2><span><strong>WHY CHOOSE 4 DAYS 3 NIGHTS</strong></span></h2><p>✔️ Deeper, unhurried resort experience<br>✔️ Cost-effective compared to booking nights separately<br>✔️ Suitable for international guests, couples, and long stays</p>', NULL, NULL),
('en_US', 7, 'test', 'ưe', '<p>qưe</p>', NULL, NULL),
('en_US', 8, '3-Day 2-Night Vũng Tàu Resort Combo at an Attractive Price | Exclusive 3-Star Hotel Offer', 'Discover the 3-day 2-night resort combo in Vũng Tàu starting from just 3,299,000 VND for 2 guests. Includes hotel accommodation, breakfast, spa voucher, pickleball, and restaurant benefits. Book now for the best rates!', '<p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\">The 3-day 2-night resort combo in Vũng Tàu is the ideal choice for travelers seeking a premium stay experience with optimal cost. The package includes 2 nights in a Superior or Deluxe Partial Sea View room, with a daily breakfast buffet.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\">Additionally, guests receive a 2-hour daily Pickleball voucher, a discount voucher for Spa services, Ruby service benefits, and a voucher for use at the Guangdong Restaurant.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;word-spacing:0px;\">With prices starting from just 3,299,000 VND for 2 guests, this is a value-for-money Vũng Tàu hotel combo, perfect for a resort getaway, beach vacation, or staycation.</p>', NULL, NULL),
('en_US', 9, 'Resort Experience', 'Premium Relaxation Retreat', '<p>Premium Relaxation Retreat</p>', 'long-son-pagoda-scaled.jpeg', '[null,\"jonnaolausson.jpg\"]'),
('en_US', 10, 'Summer Package 2026', 'Experience a luxurious summer getaway at Ruby 68 Hotel with exclusive offers for guests who book directly through our website. Includes daily breakfast buffet, spa voucher, karaoke, and many other enticing privileges.', '<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div><div class=\"relative w-full overflow-visible\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div><div class=\"relative w-full overflow-visible\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\"><p>This summer of 2026, Ruby 68 Hotel presents a special promotion exclusively for guests who book directly through our website and Direct Booking channel. This is the ideal choice for those seeking a relaxing getaway amidst the stunning blue ocean of Vũng Tàu, along with many enticing resort experiences.</p><p>With the Deluxe Partial Sea View package for 2 guests, priced from 3,450,000 VND for 3 days and 2 nights, travelers will enjoy a private retreat with a spacious balcony and a tranquil sea view.</p><p>For longer stays, the Deluxe Ocean View package for 2 guests, priced from 6,200,000 VND for 4 days and 3 nights, offers a complete resort experience with breathtaking ocean views right from your room.</p><p>When booking the Summer Package 2026, guests will enjoy numerous attractive privileges including daily breakfast buffet, 2 complimentary coconuts at the 7th-floor pool, 2 hours of karaoke on the 9th floor, a spa voucher worth 250,000 VND, and a 10% discount on F&amp;B services.</p><p>The booking period is from May 14, 2026, to May 31, 2026, with the stay valid until December 31, 2026 (not applicable during the holiday on September 1, 2026).</p><p>Plan your summer vacation today and indulge in inspiring resort experiences at Ruby 68 Hotel.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"contents\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></div>', '1-9.png', '[]'),
('en_US', 11, '3-Day 2-Night Holiday Package', '3-star relaxation, unwind by the infinity pool, and discover the renowned flavors of Peking Duck right at Ruby 68 Hotel.', '<p>𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐘 &amp; 𝐃𝐈𝐍𝐄 – 𝟑 𝐃𝐀𝐘𝐒 𝟐 𝐍𝐈𝐆𝐇𝐓𝐒<br>Experience 3-star luxury &amp; exquisite cuisine at Ruby 68 Hotel in the heart of Vũng Tàu.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:2856/1490;\" src=\"/storage/image-12.png\" alt=\"image-12.png\" width=\"2856\" height=\"1490\"></figure><p>There are vacations to escape the hustle and bustle of life.<br>And there are vacations to indulge in the finest things.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:2048/1536;\" src=\"/storage/image-15.png\" alt=\"image-15.png\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\"></figure><p>Spend 3 days and 2 nights at Ruby 68 Hotel, where each morning begins with the sunrise over Back Beach Vung Tau, gentle sea breezes from your private balcony, and moments of relaxation by the infinity pool overlooking the sea.</p><p>As the city lights begin to twinkle, your retreat continues with a special culinary experience at Guangdong Restaurant. Here, you will savor the renowned Peking Duck – a signature dish of Chinese cuisine, famous for its crispy golden skin, delicate flavors, and culinary artistry passed down through generations.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1086/1448;\" src=\"/storage/image-14.png\" alt=\"image-14.png\" width=\"1086\" height=\"1448\"></figure><p>✨ STAY &amp; DINE COMBO<br>Only 3,750,000 VND/room/2 guests/2 nights</p><p>Includes:<br>✔ 02 nights in a Deluxe Partial Sea View room<br>✔ Daily breakfast buffet<br>✔ 01 special serving of Peking Duck for 2 guests<br>✔ Spa voucher worth 250,000 VND<br>✔ 10% discount on dining &amp; beverage services during your stay</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:2856/1490;\" src=\"/storage/image-13.png\" alt=\"image-13.png\" width=\"2856\" height=\"1490\"></figure><p><br>✔ Upgrade to Deluxe Ocean for only 200,000 VND/room/night<br>✔ Experience the music program at Ruby Sky Lounge</p><p>📅 Booking period: 01/06 – 30/06/2026<br>📅 Stay period: until 31/12/2026</p><p>A beachside retreat.<br>A memorable dinner.<br>And moments worthy of enjoying with your loved ones.</p>', 'chatgpt-image-jun-1-2026-04-00-49-pm.png', '[\"chatgpt-image-jun-1-2026-04-00-49-pm.png\"]'),
('en_US', 12, 'BBQ Party Rooftop – Rooftop BBQ Party at Ruby 68 Hotel Vũng Tàu', 'Rooftop BBQ Party at Ruby 68 Hotel', '<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:6ba63580-5474-4578-af9d-c9a5d79d3822-3\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:6ba63580-5474-4578-af9d-c9a5d79d3822-3\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-8\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7579669a-830b-4604-82ac-96bf59fbcb7a\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-5-thinking\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\"><p data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"863\"><strong data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"567\">Rooftop BBQ Party at Ruby 68 Hotel Vũng Tàu</strong> is a distinctive culinary experience for guests wishing to enjoy a memorable evening by the sea. Held on the upper floor with a view overlooking Back Beach Vung Tau, the event offers a luxurious, romantic, and inspiring atmosphere for couples, families, groups of friends, or hotel guests.</p><p data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"1215\">The party features <strong data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"906\">a diverse BBQ menu</strong>, combining enticing grilled dishes, fresh seafood, and a variety of culinary options to suit the tastes of guests. Throughout the dining experience, guests will enjoy <strong data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1097\">gentle acoustic music</strong> , creating a relaxing, cozy, and refined ambiance against the stunning sunset backdrop of the coastal city.</p><p data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1475\">With a price of <strong data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1250\">599,000 VND/person</strong>, the ticket includes <strong data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1304\">one beverage or one glass of draft beer</strong>. This is the ideal choice for those seeking a beautiful dining venue in Vũng Tàu, offering delicious cuisine, impressive sea views, and a premium rooftop setting.</p><p data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1716\"><strong data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1549\">The BBQ Party Rooftop is held every Saturday from 17:00 – 21:00</strong> at Ruby 68 Hotel. Please make a reservation in advance to secure a prime spot and fully enjoy a relaxing evening with BBQ, music, and the emotional seaside scenery of Vũng Tàu.</p><p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1745\"><strong data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1745\">Program Information:</strong></p><p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1969\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1761\">Time:</strong> Every Saturday, 17:00 – 21:00<br><strong data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1806\">Ticket Price:</strong> 599,000 VND/guest<br><strong data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1839\">Includes:</strong> one beverage or one glass of draft beer<br><strong data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1890\">Location:</strong> Ruby 68 Hotel, 6 Thùy Vân, Vũng Tàu<br><strong data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1956\">Reservation:</strong> 0889 499 898</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', NULL, '[\"img-7093-1.jpg\",\"img-9723.jpg\",\"img-9715.jpg\",\"img-9713.jpg\",\"img-7071.jpg\",\"img-7037.jpg\"]'),
('en_US', 13, 'Ruby Spa – Relaxation Massage & Therapy Packages at Ruby 68 Hotel Vũng Tàu', 'Experience a journey of relaxation at Ruby Spa – Ruby 68 Hotel Vũng Tàu with massage treatments, hot stone therapy, foot care, and relaxing hair wash. The luxurious environment, gentle fragrances, and professional technicians ensure your body is restored, balanced, and re-energized.', '<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\"><p><strong>Ruby Spa at Ruby 68 Hotel Vũng Tàu</strong> offers a premium health and relaxation experience for travelers seeking a serene retreat amidst the coastal city. With a cozy, luxurious atmosphere complemented by soothing fragrances, gentle music, and meticulous service, Ruby Spa is the ideal choice for rejuvenating the body after a journey, business trip, or a long day of exploring Vũng Tàu.</p><p>The spa menu includes a variety of treatments tailored to individual needs such as <strong>Aroma Relaxation Journey</strong>, <strong>Deep Tissue Recovery</strong>, <strong>Aroma Serenity Escape</strong>, <strong>Ultimate Deep Recovery</strong>, <strong>Foot Renewal Ritual</strong>, along with packages for <strong>Hair Wash &amp; Relaxation</strong>. Each treatment is designed to alleviate stress, relax muscles, improve circulation, and provide a light, comfortable feeling after the service.</p><p>For guests who prefer gentle relaxation, the <strong>Aroma Massage</strong> combined with aromatic essential oils is the perfect choice to balance the mind and body. For those needing deeper recovery, <strong>Deep Tissue</strong> or <strong>Hot Stone Therapy</strong> targets tense muscle areas, providing a deep and pleasant relaxation experience. Additionally, foot care and relaxing hair wash services are also perfect options for a quick refresh.</p><p>Located within <strong>Ruby 68 Hotel Vũng Tàu</strong>, Ruby Spa is not only a place for body care but also an integral part of a 3-star wellness journey. It is the ideal choice for hotel guests, tourists in Vũng Tàu, couples, families, or anyone seeking a luxurious, private, and professional spa experience.</p><p><strong>Book your appointment now at Ruby Spa – Ruby 68 Hotel Vũng Tàu</strong> to enjoy moments of relaxation, recovery, and energy rejuvenation in a 3-star setting.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\">&nbsp;</div>', 'spaaaa.png', '[null,\"spa.png\",\"untitled-design-1.png\",\"20.png\",\"17-1.png\",\"16.png\"]');
