(11, 'Contact Us', '[contact-form data-vb-id=\"shortcode_1776668573_0\" display_fields=\"phone,email,subject,address\" mandatory_fields=\"phone,email\" title=\"Tin Nhắn Của Bạn\" button_label=\"Gửi\" address_icon=\"far fa-map\" address_label=\"Địa chỉ\" address_detail=\"68 Võ Thị Sáu, Vũng Tàu, Hồ Chí Minh, Việt Nam\" email_icon=\"far fa-envelope-open\" email_label=\"Email\" email_detail=\"info@ruby68hotel.com\" work_time_icon=\"far fa-clock\" phone_icon=\"fa fa-phone\" phone_label=\"Số điện thoại\" phone_detail=\"+84 254 386 8668\"][/contact-form]\n\n[google-map data-vb-id=\"shortcode_1776668573_1\" id=\"shortcode_1776668497_1\" width=\"0\" height=\"700\"] Ruby 68 Hotel, 68 Võ Thị Sáu, Vũng Tàu, Hồ Chí Minh, Việt Nam[/google-map]', 'blocks', NULL, 1, NULL, 'full-width', '', 'published', '2025-06-10 10:38:14', '2026-04-20 07:02:53'),
(12, 'Privacy', '<div class=\"about-area5 about-p p-relative\">\n    <div class=\"container pt-60 pb-90\">\n        <div class=\"service-detail\">\n            <div class=\"content-box\">\n                <h2> Privacy Statement </h2>\n                <p>First things first – your privacy is important to us. That might be the kind of thing all these notices say, but we mean it. You place your trust in us by using us services and we value that trust. That means we’re committed to protecting and safeguarding your personal data. We act in our customers’ best interest and we are transparent about the processing of your personal data.</p>\n                <p>If you’ve used us before, you know that us services offers online travel-related services through our own websites and mobile apps, as well as other online platforms such as partners’ websites and social media. We’d like to point out that all the information you are about to read, generally applies to not one, not two, but all of these platforms.</p>\n                <p>If you’ve used us before, you know that us services offers online travel-related services through our own websites and mobile apps, as well as other online platforms such as partners’ websites and social media. We’d like to point out that all the information you are about to read, generally applies to not one, not two, but all of these platforms.</p>\n\n                <h2>Terms we use in this Privacy Statement</h2>\n                <p>\'Trip\' means the various different travel products and services that can be ordered, acquired, purchased, bought, paid, rented, provided, reserved, combined, or consummated by you from the Trip Provider.</p>\n                <p>\'Trip Provider\' means the provider of accommodation (e.g. hotel, motel, apartment, bed & breakfast, landlord), attractions (e.g. (theme) parks, museums, sightseeing tours), transportation provider (e.g. car rentals, cruises, rail, airport rides, coach tours, transfers), tour operators, travel insurances and any other travel or related product or service as from time to time available for Trip Reservation on the platform.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 'full-width', NULL, 'published', '2025-06-10 10:38:14', '2025-06-10 10:38:14'),
(13, 'Term and Conditions', '<div class=\"about-area5 about-p p-relative\">\n    <div class=\"container pt-60 pb-90\">\n        <div class=\"service-detail\">\n            <div class=\"content-box\">\n                <h3>Definitions</h3>\n                <p>Some of the words you’ll see have very specific meanings, so please check out the ‘RioRelax dictionary’ at the end of these Terms.</p>\n\n                <h3>About these terms</h3>\n                <p>When you complete your Booking, you accept these Terms and any other terms that you’re provided with during the booking process.</p>\n                <p>The English version of these Terms is the original. If there’s any dispute about the Terms, or any mismatch between the Terms in English and in another language, the Terms as they appear in English will apply. (You can change the language at the top of this page.</p>\n\n                <h3>Our Platform</h3>\n                <p> We take reasonable care in providing our Platform, but we can’t guarantee that everything on it is accurate (we get information from the Service Providers). To the extent permitted by law, we can’t be held responsible for any errors, any interruptions, or any missing bits of information - although we will do everything we can to correct/fix them as soon as we can.</p>\n                <P>We will show you the offers that are available to you, in (what we think is) the right language for you. You can change to another language whenever you like.</P>\n\n                <h3>Prices</h3>\n                <p> When you make a Booking, you agree to pay the cost of the Travel Experience, including any charges and taxes that may apply.</p>\n                <p> Some of the prices you see may have been rounded to the nearest whole number. The price you pay will be based on the original, \'non-rounded\' price (although the actual difference will be tiny anyway).</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 'full-width', NULL, 'published', '2025-06-10 10:38:14', '2025-06-10 10:38:14'),
(18, 'Sảnh Lễ Tân', NULL, 'html', '<div class=\"rb-wrap\"><style>\r\n    * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box }\r\n    .rb-wrap { font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#444 }\r\n    .rb-hero { position:relative; height:clamp(260px,42vw,460px); overflow:hidden }\r\n    .rb-hero img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block }\r\n    .rb-hero-mask { position:absolute; inset:0; background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);\r\n        display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; align-items:center; text-align:center; padding:20px }\r\n    .rb-hero-mask span { color:#fff; letter-spacing:5px; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:12px }\r\n    .rb-hero-mask h1 { color:#fff; font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,52px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:2px }\r\n    .rb-body { max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; padding:50px 20px 60px }\r\n    .rb-lead { font-size:17px; line-height:1.95; color:#555; text-align:center; max-width:820px; margin:0 auto 40px }\r\n    .rb-facts { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr)); gap:18px; margin-bottom:45px }\r\n    .rb-fact { border:1px solid #e6e6e6; border-top:3px solid #0e4d97; padding:22px 20px; background:#fff }\r\n    .rb-fact b { display:block; color:#0e4d97; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:8px }\r\n    .rb-fact p { font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#666 }\r\n    .rb-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:12px }\r\n    .rb-grid img { width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/3; object-fit:cover; display:block }\r\n    @media (max-width:600px) { .rb-body { padding:34px 15px 40px } .rb-lead { font-size:15px } }\r\n</style><div class=\"rb-hero\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621293954908-907159247fc8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&h=900&q=80\" alt=\"Sảnh Lễ Tân\"><div class=\"rb-hero-mask\"><span>Ruby 68 Hotel</span><h1>Sảnh Lễ Tân</h1></div></div><div class=\"rb-body\"><p class=\"rb-lead\">Quầy lễ tân Ruby 68 Hotel phục vụ 24/7, hỗ trợ nhận phòng, trả phòng, giữ hành lý và tư vấn thông tin du lịch Vũng Tàu. Khu vực chờ có ghế ngồi thoải mái và nước uống miễn phí.</p><div class=\"rb-facts\"><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Giờ phục vụ</b><p>24/7</p></div><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Hỗ trợ</b><p>Nhận/trả phòng, giữ hành lý, gọi taxi</p></div><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Tiện ích</b><p>Khu vực chờ, nước uống miễn phí, Wi-Fi</p></div></div><div class=\"rb-grid\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493663284031-b7e3aefcae8e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=675&q=80\" alt=\"Sảnh Lễ Tân\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560448204-e02f11c3d0e2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=675&q=80\" alt=\"Sảnh Lễ Tân\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503174971373-b1f69850bded?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=675&q=80\" alt=\"Sảnh Lễ Tân\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554995207-c18c203602cb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=675&q=80\" alt=\"Sảnh Lễ Tân\"></div></div></div>', 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621293954908-907159247fc8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80', 'full-width', 'Quầy lễ tân Ruby 68 Hotel phục vụ 24/7, hỗ trợ nhận phòng, trả phòng, giữ hành lý và tư vấn thông tin du lịch Vũng Tàu. Khu vực chờ có ghế ngồi thoải mái và nước uống miễn phí.', 'published', '2026-03-25 09:03:48', '2026-08-04 08:10:14'),
(19, 'Hồ Bơi', NULL, 'html', '<div class=\"rb-wrap\"><style>\r\n    * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box }\r\n    .rb-wrap { font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#444 }\r\n    .rb-hero { position:relative; height:clamp(260px,42vw,460px); overflow:hidden }\r\n    .rb-hero img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block }\r\n    .rb-hero-mask { position:absolute; inset:0; background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);\r\n        display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; align-items:center; text-align:center; padding:20px }\r\n    .rb-hero-mask span { color:#fff; letter-spacing:5px; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:12px }\r\n    .rb-hero-mask h1 { color:#fff; font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,52px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:2px }\r\n    .rb-body { max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; padding:50px 20px 60px }\r\n    .rb-lead { font-size:17px; line-height:1.95; color:#555; text-align:center; max-width:820px; margin:0 auto 40px }\r\n    .rb-facts { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr)); gap:18px; margin-bottom:45px }\r\n    .rb-fact { border:1px solid #e6e6e6; border-top:3px solid #0e4d97; padding:22px 20px; background:#fff }\r\n    .rb-fact b { display:block; color:#0e4d97; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:8px }\r\n    .rb-fact p { font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#666 }\r\n    .rb-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:12px }\r\n    .rb-grid img { width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/3; object-fit:cover; display:block }\r\n    @media (max-width:600px) { .rb-body { padding:34px 15px 40px } .rb-lead { font-size:15px } }\r\n</style><div class=\"rb-hero\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562778612-e1e0cda9915c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&h=900&q=80\" alt=\"Hồ Bơi\"><div class=\"rb-hero-mask\"><span>Ruby 68 Hotel</span><h1>Hồ Bơi</h1></div></div><div class=\"rb-body\"><p class=\"rb-lead\">Hồ bơi ngoài trời dành riêng cho khách lưu trú tại Ruby 68 Hotel. Không gian gọn gàng, yên tĩnh, phù hợp để thư giãn sau một ngày dạo biển Vũng Tàu.</p><div class=\"rb-facts\"><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Giờ mở cửa</b><p>6:00 – 21:00 hằng ngày</p></div><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Đối tượng</b><p>Miễn phí cho khách lưu trú</p></div><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Tiện ích</b><p>Ghế nằm, dù che nắng, khăn tắm miễn phí</p></div></div><div class=\"rb-grid\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1575429198097-0414ec08e8cd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=675&q=80\" alt=\"Hồ Bơi\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576013551627-0cc20b96c2a7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=675&q=80\" alt=\"Hồ Bơi\"></div></div></div>', 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562778612-e1e0cda9915c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80', 'full-width', 'Hồ bơi ngoài trời dành riêng cho khách lưu trú tại Ruby 68 Hotel. Không gian gọn gàng, yên tĩnh, phù hợp để thư giãn sau một ngày dạo biển Vũng Tàu.', 'published', '2026-03-25 16:22:30', '2026-03-30 11:09:08'),
(22, 'Bãi Đỗ Xe', NULL, 'html', '<div class=\"rb-wrap\"><style>\r\n    * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box }\r\n    .rb-wrap { font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#444 }\r\n    .rb-hero { position:relative; height:clamp(260px,42vw,460px); overflow:hidden }\r\n    .rb-hero img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block }\r\n    .rb-hero-mask { position:absolute; inset:0; background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);\r\n        display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; align-items:center; text-align:center; padding:20px }\r\n    .rb-hero-mask span { color:#fff; letter-spacing:5px; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:12px }\r\n    .rb-hero-mask h1 { color:#fff; font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,52px); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:2px }\r\n    .rb-body { max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; padding:50px 20px 60px }\r\n    .rb-lead { font-size:17px; line-height:1.95; color:#555; text-align:center; max-width:820px; margin:0 auto 40px }\r\n    .rb-facts { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr)); gap:18px; margin-bottom:45px }\r\n    .rb-fact { border:1px solid #e6e6e6; border-top:3px solid #0e4d97; padding:22px 20px; background:#fff }\r\n    .rb-fact b { display:block; color:#0e4d97; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:8px }\r\n    .rb-fact p { font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#666 }\r\n    .rb-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:12px }\r\n    .rb-grid img { width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/3; object-fit:cover; display:block }\r\n    @media (max-width:600px) { .rb-body { padding:34px 15px 40px } .rb-lead { font-size:15px } }\r\n</style><div class=\"rb-hero\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470224114660-3f6686c562eb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&h=900&q=80\" alt=\"Bãi Đỗ Xe\"><div class=\"rb-hero-mask\"><span>Ruby 68 Hotel</span><h1>Bãi Đỗ Xe</h1></div></div><div class=\"rb-body\"><p class=\"rb-lead\">Ruby 68 Hotel có bãi đỗ xe miễn phí dành cho khách lưu trú, có mái che và bảo vệ trực 24/7. Nhận giữ cả ô tô và xe máy ngay tại khách sạn.</p><div class=\"rb-facts\"><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Giờ hoạt động</b><p>24/7, có bảo vệ trực</p></div><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Chi phí</b><p>Miễn phí cho khách lưu trú</p></div><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Loại xe</b><p>Ô tô và xe máy</p></div></div><div class=\"rb-grid\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590674899484-d5640e854abe?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=675&q=80\" alt=\"Bãi Đỗ Xe\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573348722427-f1d6819fdf98?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=675&q=80\" alt=\"Bãi Đỗ Xe\"></div></div></div>', 1, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470224114660-3f6686c562eb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80', 'full-width', 'Ruby 68 Hotel có bãi đỗ xe miễn phí dành cho khách lưu trú, có mái che và bảo vệ trực 24/7. Nhận giữ cả ô tô và xe máy ngay tại khách sạn.', 'published', '2026-03-25 16:25:58', '2026-03-30 11:09:17');
