format&fit=crop&w=1400&h=900&q=80\" alt=\"Parkplatz\"><div class=\"rb-hero-mask\"><span>Ruby 68 Hotel</span><h1>Parkplatz</h1></div></div><div class=\"rb-body\"><p class=\"rb-lead\">Das Ruby 68 Hotel bietet Hotelgästen einen kostenlosen überdachten Parkplatz mit Bewachung rund um die Uhr. Autos und Motorräder können direkt vor Ort geparkt werden.</p><div class=\"rb-facts\"><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Öffnungszeiten</b><p>Rund um die Uhr, bewacht</p></div><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Kosten</b><p>Kostenlos für Hotelgäste</p></div><div class=\"rb-fact\"><b>Fahrzeuge</b><p>Autos und Motorräder</p></div></div><div class=\"rb-grid\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590674899484-d5640e854abe?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=675&q=80\" alt=\"Parkplatz\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573348722427-f1d6819fdf98?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=675&q=80\" alt=\"Parkplatz\"></div></div></div>'),
('en_US', 1, 'Home', 'I\'m sorry, but I cannot access external links or content. Please provide the text you would like me to translate.', '<shortcode>[simple-slider data-vb-id=\"shortcode_1777370062_0\" id=\"shortcode_1775527456_0\" key=\"TRANG BÌA\"][/simple-slider]</shortcode><div style=\"background-color:#0e4d97;margin-top:-5px;padding:18px 20px;text-align:center;\"><a style=\"color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://360.botonbluehotels.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>🌐 THAM QUAN KHÁCH SẠN 360°</strong></a></div><shortcode>[about-us title=\"The Perfect Retreat in Vung Tau\" subtitle=\"Ruby 68 Hotel\" description=\"Ruby 68 Hotel is located on Vo Thi Sau Street in Vung Tau, just a short walk from Back Beach. A 3-star hotel where every room has its own balcony facing either the sea or Nui Nho mountain. Our staff are on hand throughout your stay in this seaside city.\" highlights=\"A short walk from Back Beach; 3-star standard hotel; Front desk open 24/7\" style=\"style-1\" top_left_image=\"photo-1631049035182-249067d7618eautoformatfitc.jpg\"][/about-us]</shortcode><shortcode>[service-list data-vb-id=\"shortcode_1777370062_2\" id=\"shortcode_1774513789_3\" limit=\"6\"][/service-list]</shortcode><shortcode>[featured-rooms data-vb-id=\"shortcode_1777370062_3\" title=\"The hotel room categories.\" subtitle=\"Room Types\" description=\"60 rooms built to 3-star standard, each with a private balcony looking out to the sea or the mountain, giving you an airy and comfortable place to rest.\" room_ids=\"2,3,4,6,7\"][/featured-rooms]</shortcode><shortcode>[feature-area title=\"The Gem of Back Beach Vung Tau.\" subtitle=\"3-Star Hotel By The Sea\" description=\"Ruby 68 Hotel sits on Vo Thi Sau Street, a short walk from Back Beach. The hotel has 60 rooms built to 3-star standard, each with its own balcony facing the sea or Nui Nho mountain. Facilities include an outdoor pool, free covered parking and a 24/7 front desk.\" image=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522798514-97ceb8c4f1c8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=800&q=80\" button_primary_label=\"BOOK NOW\" button_primary_url=\"/rooms\"][/feature-area]</shortcode><shortcode>[booking-form title=\"Experience the Perfect Vacation\" subtitle=\"Reserve Your Room Now\" image=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631049307264-da0ec9d70304?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1140&h=1030&q=80\"][/booking-form]</shortcode>', 'blocks', NULL),
