 relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/E2q1y5Rebwf7GjFJ5z0R9cWcatG19Vx9RF2V4Kpfxw4d_kZYjUwDracWK66ZyLqA0GHKJ5fbu5zwOOUKIgm99Yzi7AUfHUTXGgwFzX3AuILb2modWC1LqHmFlbU3rkXmeKI27CViveoj07PWvp7xYVpMH5E7htFpuvQyM_2npj0?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/IpW9phzFf63edpRc3uzTtWfS5Tk3nloCjcjCzdUOI9kv7ox73Usz-GfSCJMeyMvXWBy0xJaM6u056p5MwZZ632tViBYls9Hp_qN4YYr1OJb56j-wpLNX-Fs5cELUT9bSZdx4e7pSjXxm8TnWvKJ5sIS0zRp2zpiNJB3iFQSnEXJy5_ILCrU8RlK4aKsP8xnT?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/i1SyZJp-VMHEzDgsgPwIngrDKcyaDoRzS_TgNZ7viBSEFJozcwIUkkupkeM3ed80oD8yf8lHTAJ9OMJvLicf_bJEoK_l22Y2YSrpw7NS_t4WdjokKE5ZVWfTFXB1XVxj-ekSpooR3xUZYbgTV2WrOV3aQPLSLxEOswZUdcXRpDw?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ACnl8wcF-2Y5tLwn0kIRcoRgjLw8AAgGDBtMp8crZ7-_snHzCicO9Gu3eM8m1pNBQLAnhUd9NvcOAqxyyEjGOwJ-CTZJaCC4eWv-kXee-dyIby5tBQEsz3KEcb9KM8LcVyMCVg9E1iISj_CVDZuWwDG5_p46PX-q8UhAYGZnumjoLGwrSaJdpbv5AqF1bemv?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>Một trong những bãi biển đẹp và yên tĩnh nhất, thích hợp để thư giãn.</p><h2>🛍️ 9. Chợ địa phương (chợ Đầm, chợ Xóm Mới)</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/_pV3cOraufRIQYlwUB5tuufHcr50CMxr5cCn8K1IVkSYZtOe4EXqyrmu8BubIfyMf87QWgIVbk9HriYwR7Tp-0izZNLoCC-PIvx3oU2oE0gYMDjsM0b6r6U3j09RP_kQ5Ilg_9MT66nHU2c6TW229FSOLSgR8p-lfFaFSezcZUI?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/6yqiDkEThxWzw3rtOnKBwS7wKvkPTerQv2Pvr-MVUk86-Z8w9j_0bje_7L0Kk15nxupqVwhgE-sSKI1uyA2KiN2213SLtYVgvNeORc7LQBBDSJnjNiq-yqOCH0e4-TGTgB4Kz4jsZwnWRtoTrXna2_sVvyfIS2ucPMTdt68OxJrcJqFNsxiwXcNJZd30etLs?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><p>Bạn có thể tham quan, tìm hiểu văn hóa địa phương mà không cần chi tiêu.</p><h2>🌅 10. Dạo biển &amp; ngắm bình minh – hoàng hôn</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/pI89M3414ucORPTU1uXNsDxG6F9a5MQWKPPxzQD0zQiZvm7lm6RTv-SN4sWFlHlA-zwn6p-53usl91IuCoNb-jdcCiychBy6Uddm1sTs87C08LQH-gISvP0k8rfARlNm9TEmLIZm2dNVrIZ3jQ2aDQbkNkRDqq2gYbJA62-z3UeFyqp076srGpmDYbvGcwby?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/MY24Wns_ZdKkWyM29QkrI3IA0boVje_hQ1Bvm8r4CLL_rscFf6rV9ZN8e0kQG5zXVUTmTcBHnGh5r1B4l8Nhe1Bw0cWm2IFj8nJzcXKyo-MaosfsBsAVqV5gaNcwm3ZQIM8F1qy-ZGtJI4L0NXX9jTCiG2PJkDT02shjO5R67e479NCDaKSTcHHfWVi9n9wa?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><p>Một trong những trải nghiệm đẹp nhất – hoàn toàn miễn phí nhưng đầy cảm xúc.</p><h2>✨ Trải nghiệm thông minh – nghỉ dưỡng trọn vẹn</h2><p>Ngay cả khi lựa chọn những điểm tham quan miễn phí, bạn vẫn có thể kết hợp với một kỳ nghỉ cao cấp tại Ruby 68 Hotel để tận hưởng sự thoải mái, riêng tư và dịch vụ chuẩn 3 sao.</p><p><strong>Vũng Tàu không chỉ dành cho những kỳ nghỉ xa hoa – mà còn là điểm đến nơi bạn có thể tận hưởng vẻ đẹp trọn vẹn theo cách đơn giản và tinh tế nhất.</strong></p>', 'published', 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 0, 0, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590073242678-70ee3fc28e8e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80', 4632, NULL, '2026-04-27 08:51:00', '2026-04-27 10:10:45');
