/static-rsc-4/i1SyZJp-VMHEzDgsgPwIngrDKcyaDoRzS_TgNZ7viBSEFJozcwIUkkupkeM3ed80oD8yf8lHTAJ9OMJvLicf_bJEoK_l22Y2YSrpw7NS_t4WdjokKE5ZVWfTFXB1XVxj-ekSpooR3xUZYbgTV2WrOV3aQPLSLxEOswZUdcXRpDw?purpose=inline\"></div></button></div><p data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1448\">Một hòn đảo còn khá hoang sơ, phù hợp cho những ai thích biển xanh và không gian ít đông đúc.</p><h2 data-section-id=\"1kkdvde\" data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1534\">🌄 5. <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Đèo Lương Sơn</span> – Góc săn ảnh biển từ trên cao</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open image details for [2024] Luong Son Pass in Vũng Tàu, a coveted route for backpackers – GEMNUTS\"><div><img alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/k28yX4u4zkMd7pUvKJU8oY3Jwe3lI3mhabaj3kHwVK-SdyXvR7O9jjVCkTPUSBM99xg90PlaJtlaYLNrbTbxkztrJnh1xKZsD0YDKILUGh86s7T2m3jOD03rIxnFT0jiearxlyd1KtwWPdX8fPtf7kXdjLT8mk2ZecdUWnA614b8aEKWGcQcKmTTslMTmYI3?purpose=fullsize\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/KzKlyABjsRjWFBXNITZORxxkceoMyD_OTr6v4uO1gRD9i_5A4WXGcoHSDn98Z8Hb3CMTSEkAHeACXxmCQmS6cv3mpy9Fx5QsYkUynSF0D