lt relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/NZPjpK9tQzwmvk7nHB-myIrSTdJAvjQ6L9FP_gebRSxs6N9lG2uRpFTwrMJ_2EcvdxHR3fJwwoe3eiYkebDZktALdz3UUSA0ghaD74rqv3VbgzT3AIfkLCsz5BRok1uyf5Hjl9yZ1W92P5kmacD-rlDl-xSVziI6puR5o3rj4n8?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/f9FWVytRw46PkOHBeRIBOwfd_0ie-s-uPwtPQeH5v9fygXanftF_agI0wqeIRoySaBNKGM5F911uR6-9G-iqQGquFJ0tNdUQLUzVwqur8wE3LBJ_xBbY9RrY6f2uvDqiWrtjOge7jdJVKc3W_bRh2cBSmGANCpDFXiMz-GBny1pBVen4GBkD_k5G4w0SSE0W?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p>Havana Sky Bar is the ideal destination for relaxing evenings with cocktails and an emotionally stirring ocean view.</p><h2>🪨 6. Mũi Nghinh Phong Cafe – A café amidst natural wonders</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/eWS2OkBdm4am1ImAnb3w1yvlu02f6_d5xuR69-RznlWZHjXLH0n5-wLO_vgqR1pfBSoU9HV4Q948oaoeRHcLw1t-S42UayEBo4c6nLd4ajS9HT9-F7IP6-_F4ebGPoRUlHYxlDKp4sWgZjiiFXnUjwq6suhZqRsAAOU1HCTcczM?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/JKhyC1LO8Q_eWK0AtwQlJ6ka_Y9XQfe78WCA1fXn7T5rldnOoy4gJw3bJRSaUPxhuW5WdRhJs-K1LRuKxOyifRDbAdpfVKpgnCTt86wy1_5FnMrATU5xKKevTezejdxI4AVn3HgprAdK28xBur7zRKC7pQgy5lqjbBvjFHcmM_vPhRqwSQ-xmgDJ-61KBEya?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/AxSXdgbZhgyrphwx6SY0srl4hiZJ5_UAYZyjh4xTEPU9JXcfNaXpMsWgSxIxQkIJoQTNET9fm7561CziwIUUAZKTAG-OTFORWmS02KzPmL0laOsELhabH__XcjJfZ5RBOsfA5TeELvU9PIN3wE896Dl9gW7esarCoO9B6KAz2Mg?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/3j8g4ptWOol8w7raIXs4i_krqKxUaDhKi6GdzIOKGzOfN5M2brpD-ZhlJr36Ccnw2HYz6s5-GlT_JAjlVEG3GrvQ-Sy7PfO1wsGrLsCacTkvq-oR8JTcoI0YQ4CX0rD1DEAT-QfgY3Niml5sXxhWSy5glxiWuokpHEKOnXk5k_65hY99PFh60mYPrtUf2Woy?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p>Located near the Mũi Nghinh Phong scenic area, this café offers a unique experience – where you can enjoy coffee while admiring the unique natural rock formations blending with the blue sea.</p><p>The simple space, yet the natural view creates a special value, suitable for those who love rustic and peaceful settings.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>🌿 7. Amiana Resort Coffee – A resort-standard café experience</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/gWBWRFxBAjuOwn6BFibHweZmsHtwP-cjnMzuWzXUrA7_d05KRuDOyjAF6uB1BvYpKc8opIyfwEswESkG3DOFQh-e8vYr9-FqS7WAZxfINaZZpAitxwN6QmUP3yX0zfOyAmKUYoFc7Prj0cqzpwu0DTLFrbh5QQicSGfIouYYmVM?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ajCyewHOT_HP8tdnHl2HiVR66joYpS5DAgPY-xgD13zu39nrNju3ng_9myNIpTYpoAIlx5MKKqA3QRhCAkU6NVK7CK92PfVt2SlLEyD1Xblp9_BHu2K1AxtQ-cMgTeQc7yfwbCE1pcTF3rMaDTmKexTvhAa3_y3MUFZjvzhvlUWHC5VLznxVO1GHWjvnilnx?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><br>Amiana Resort Coffee offers a café experience in a high-end resort setting with stunning ocean and lagoon views. This is the perfect choice for those seeking privacy, luxury, and tranquility.</div></div></div><h2>✨ Experience seaside café in your own style at Ruby 68</h2><p>If you are looking for a private, tranquil space with an impressive ocean view, Ruby 68 Hotel is the ideal choice.</p><p>Here, guests can enjoy morning coffee by the infinity pool, savor drinks at the 27th-floor rooftop, or relax on the room balcony with a panoramic view of the bay.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:5165/3443;\" src=\"/storage/17-blue-ocean-bar.jpg\" alt=\"17-blue-ocean-bar.jpg\" width=\"5165\" height=\"3443\"></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Vũng Tàu – where each cup of coffee is not just a flavor, but an emotional experience amidst stunning nature.</strong></p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552566626-52f8b828add9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80'),
('en_US', 47, 'Discover Vũng Tàu Night Market - An Unmissable Tourist Destination', 'The vibrant rhythm and cultural hues as the city lights up', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/OXWT1k9zxg6Qmd2QOZ6m9LfXh62OmovD6Ee0rZJKTAcJl5RQx-C7r28bgV80OHWTIUD9CYiYIq4GDjAQklT0qjnlkGLrQKmRAGwKQ-Nm7RZmUnW2krVTN7WH5tAN9_NVlQsbeaGEmsbw993nKjxFTxALicDS7NyeDsYlbERn7eg?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/0k6V6IALQyNCUCnX28fWv0k-EpF3TSbnqwIq1-MrQER72IjwmpsJ3jTh5Y11tVklAKX8QQ8H3hkf3fjHoSI8FoMIESyMcls1FJ3M7xlSQSbn9PrGN3kLJGfq0YGYtlJMeYbydmuvonAOpGWZDS-_Eidy8O2yZp8n6yz-prTHj3k79NWnQY0rtxT1L4nVbmOF?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/pMexU0m8VVI4QbieUbmTL19ZOlsAULFdquZgoQh9QApvLO8ZUBk2GRzMJ5l2x8i6bcD44mIe8R93siEtRiPGOi3xxOnshb1gOJBrCYTDFD3efifFVqEzaor4EEHLJ-Ft4EczUvD67cSUWRLJlYx7SBDx-mh7ttl0Xdm3fLN3Xr4?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/D-w8JcEGbnlQ6jfi7bpZs8R_UFZ4B-A0hq2vB_K2TLBZHGVftcNqB8barP3VZpQu-QIEarHVhYSrTAYMUhK81RWJw_iD8YhoYP-2_sbj17QXeLNEY0kHlMGFjrswSOd6SkDzRIqyzyPXZwAfrKfRBNQIyO4hAOm9AtOAGnw2VjhZrWJyKTrkP-znEbYvn8NL?purpose=fullsize\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section><div><div><div><div><div><div><p><br>As the sunset gradually descends over the city <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> , <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu Night Market</span> begins to bustle, offering an entirely different atmosphere – a convergence of street food, shopping, and vibrant cultural experiences.</p><p>More than just a sightseeing spot, the night market is a place to truly feel the local rhythm and the friendliness of Vũng Tàu&#039;s people.</p><hr><h2>🌃 A Vibrant Space in the Heart of the Coastal City</h2><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:800/600;\" src=\"https://ik.imagekit.io/tvlk/blog/2023/01/cho-dem-nha-trang-1.jpg?tr=q-70,c-at_max,w-1000,h-600\" alt=\"Explore Vũng Tàu Night Market - An Unmissable Tourist Destination\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\"></figure><p>Located right in the central area, near Tran Phu beach road, the night market is an ideal destination for evening strolls. The dazzling rows of lanterns, lively sounds, and bustling crowds create a dynamic and captivating atmosphere.</p><p>Strolling here, visitors not only immerse themselves in the bustling ambiance but also experience the unique charm of a dynamic and friendly tourist city.</p><hr><h2>🍢 A Street Food Paradise</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/RLtSgnOt6-OJz5l-9ALfX1LUs91g5FI_0FYoZIQURGvelkwOEg86khmUbVlOkolD-gvGLzgBZG70cl9cbRFtY2xt4CJSR5cHt1wfdpGs8zr2ECWKpcRcHrhYyXoj76f4e0h6Q592OIyG75xeXGbD2nbO-LX3InmjXGt3JCMl30c?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/qH45s3kVjAEh-q-GO5MofPAZ-gMvvtFmiaqCpKgYQFUqsTaSSUpwxHCrNmpU2qQcMIRiN3WWv4QX6Yad3A8h8OrU-us4L2wesTuJGIKm3PICCLGm2fMtCHIWv7YUe2yEgzv5ZBM--eSKVL0pj2QBzkt7HBC3vF2n3Tih6NEIxdl1ef6NAiaErBqCXsAJFurv?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/cHpXczS5vGXlmdEFGWXjB_Nb7_w7yrbdRXURpEpGDuDKXp57MsTyj9nFYrWD870cfLyStTOU5pMH4OdR0hUxqdTBg9sCUs_ye7bjdYbWRJqGP3y-km0rrhAHBvFlU9sM3q-NRNuUoOQCNvHjG6yuMpiFXdwTvtMroQ-Gszh5lPA?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/cBwgncbrSuoy_YTyQjw7m4J00jUL1GP2-JjUkLwvfwj9OzDhspQIvsIRzLu8-tV5sFGEdQ93fUTzdBpDaX4oEPVySD6J99AESCnTfgHpKILh_9jZuP_qo-993NM5oyAD4ZwvPEZZBaHPWOsWMlrAEf2CNvYZ--PT6RxpveMj1UhrHhrFXhkaXXPSg6X8LSnW?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div><p>Vũng Tàu Night Market is a gathering place for a plethora of enticing dishes – from fragrant grilled seafood to signature dishes like grilled pork rolls, grilled rice paper, fish noodles, and local snacks.</p><p>The aroma wafting from the stalls, the sizzling sound of grills, and the diverse choices make this place a &#039;culinary paradise&#039; for anyone who loves to explore local flavors.</p><h2>🛍️ Shop for Unique Souvenirs</h2><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:800/640;\" src=\"https://lilystravelagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/night-market-nha-trang7.png\" alt=\"Night market Vũng Tàu: Local life &amp; delights - Lily&#039;s Travel Agency\" width=\"800\" height=\"640\"></figure><p>Besides the cuisine, the night market is also an ideal place to find souvenirs that bear the hallmark of Vũng Tàu. From handicrafts, jewelry, clothing to shell and pearl products... all are displayed in a diverse and eye-catching manner.</p><p>This is also an opportunity for visitors to experience local shopping culture, interact with vendors, and bring home meaningful gifts for loved ones.</p><h2>🎶 Cultural and Entertainment Experiences</h2><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1024/767;\" src=\"https://comnhanhatrang.vn/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/chodem-1024x767.jpg\" alt=\"Savor the Cuisine and Vibrant Atmosphere at Vũng Tàu Night Market - Com Nha Vũng Tàu\" width=\"1024\" height=\"767\"></figure><p>The night market space is not just about shopping and dining. Occasionally, visitors can catch street performances, music, or small interactive activities, creating a joyful and friendly atmosphere.</p><p>The combination of cuisine, shopping, and entertainment has made the night market an indispensable destination in the journey of exploring Vũng Tàu.</p><h2>✨ A Complete Journey from Relaxation to Exploration</h2><p>From Ruby 68 Hotel, guests can easily travel to the night market to enjoy the vibrant atmosphere of the city at night.</p><p>After an evening of strolling, savoring cuisine, and shopping, you can return to the hotel to relax in a luxurious space, enjoy the infinity pool, or sip a cocktail on the rooftop – concluding a perfect day in Vũng Tàu.</p><p><strong>Vũng Tàu Night Market – where every step is an experience, every corner tells a story, and every moment is filled with the vitality of the coastal city.</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1414235077428-338989a2e8c0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80');
INSERT INTO `posts_translations` (`lang_code`, `posts_id`, `name`, `description`, `content`, `image`) VALUES
('en_US', 48, 'Guide to Getting Around When Traveling in Vũng Tàu', 'Easily explore the coastal city in the most convenient and comfortable way', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><p>Vũng Tàu is one of the premier tourist destinations in Vietnam, renowned for its stunning beaches, mild climate, and well-developed tourism infrastructure. Getting around in <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> is quite convenient with many options to suit every need—from free exploration to luxurious relaxation.</p><p>Below are popular transportation methods to help you fully enjoy your journey in this coastal city.</p><h2>✈️ Traveling to Vũng Tàu</h2><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1920/1080;\" src=\"https://cdn2.tuoitre.vn/471584752817336320/2023/4/18/tp-nha-trang-16818161974101240202452.jpeg\" alt=\"Vũng Tàu Travel Guide: Explore the Beach Paradise - Tuoi Tre Online\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></figure><p>The fastest way to reach Vũng Tàu is by air, landing at <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Long Thành International Airport</span> – approximately 35 km from the city center.</p><p>From the airport, travelers can choose:</p><ul><li><strong>Taxi / Private Car</strong>: convenient, travel time about 40–50 minutes</li><li><strong>Hotel Shuttle</strong>: private service, ideal for leisure guests</li><li><strong>Airport Bus</strong>: cost-effective, suitable for solo travelers</li></ul><h2>🚗 Getting Around the City</h2><h3>🚕 Taxi – Quick and Convenient</h3><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:800/533;\" src=\"https://digiticket.vn/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/taxi-nha-trang-4.jpg\" alt=\"Latest Compilation of 12 Quality, Affordable Vũng Tàu Taxi Companies - Digiticket\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\"></figure><p>Taxis are the most common and easiest choice for moving between attractions. Transparent pricing, suitable for families or small groups.</p><h3>🛵 Motorbike Rental – Freedom to Explore</h3><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1080/809;\" src=\"https://statics.vinpearl.com/phuot-nha-trang-bang-xe-may-01_1694054591.jpg\" alt=\"Exploring Vũng Tàu by Motorbike and the Experience You Need to Know\" width=\"1080\" height=\"809\"></figure><p>If you want to control your schedule, renting a motorbike is an ideal choice. With reasonable costs, you can easily reach famous spots like <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Hon Chong</span> or <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Long Son Pagoda</span> .</p><p>However, be sure to ensure traffic safety and carry all necessary documents.</p><h3>🚖 Ride-Hailing Services – Flexible and Modern</h3><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1024/683;\" src=\"https://cdn.xanhsm.com/2023/06/d13d0ae2-dipi9911-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"TAXI XANH SM LAUNCHES SERVICE IN VŨNG TÀU | Xanh SM\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\"></figure><p>Ride-hailing apps like <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Grab</span> make it easy to book a ride with clear pricing. This is a suitable choice for young travelers or those familiar with technology.</p><h3>🚶‍♂️ Walking – Experience Local Life</h3><p>The central area of Vũng Tàu is quite walkable, especially along the coastal Tran Phu Street. This is an ideal way to enjoy the sea breeze, explore cafes, restaurants, and night markets at a leisurely and complete pace.</p><h2>🚤 Traveling to the Islands</h2><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/800;\" src=\"https://newlifetravel.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/thue-cano-du-lich-nha-trang-1.jpg\" alt=\"Price List for Renting Canoes in Vũng Tàu - Updated 2025\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\"></figure><p>One of the must-have experiences when visiting Vũng Tàu is exploring the beautiful islands.</p><p>From the port, travelers can take a canoe or boat to famous spots like <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Hon Mun Island</span> – a diving paradise with vibrant coral ecosystems.</p><p>Island tours are often organized as all-inclusive packages, including transfers, lunch, and sea activities.</p><h2>✨ Choosing Transportation to Suit Your Travel Style</h2><p>Choosing a mode of transportation depends on each person&#039;s needs and travel style:</p><ul><li><strong>Luxury Relaxation</strong>: prioritize private cars, taxis, or shuttle services</li><li><strong>Free Exploration</strong>: rent a motorbike or use ride-hailing services</li><li><strong>Gentle Experience</strong>: combine walking and taxis</li></ul><p>At Ruby 68 Hotel, guests can easily arrange transportation through the concierge service, ensuring convenience and comfort throughout the journey.</p><h2>🌊 Easy Transportation – Complete Experience</h2><p>A convenient journey will help you fully enjoy Vũng Tàu—from gentle beach strolls to inspiring island explorations.</p><p><strong>Vũng Tàu is not only beautiful for its scenery but also easily conquered by its convenient transportation—where every journey becomes light and memorable.</strong></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\">&nbsp;</div>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544148103-0773bf10d330?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80'),
('en_US', 49, 'What Does Vũng Tàu Offer at Night?', 'Discover a Vibrant Vũng Tàu as the City Lights Up', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><p>As the sun sets over the bay <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> , the seaside city transforms into a completely different beauty – vibrant, lively, yet romantic enough to captivate any visitor. From evening beach strolls, savoring culinary delights, exploring night markets to rooftop bars and lively entertainment venues, Vũng Tàu at night offers a myriad of memorable experiences.</p><p>Here are the things you shouldn&#039;t miss when exploring Vũng Tàu after sunset.</p><h2>🌃 Stroll Along Tran Phu Beach – Feel the City&#039;s Rhythm</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/glnqisuvBO5pojMNC7GBC7Hmsy5I8iXh_DUqlXWMbHPXBIrA7Hn8cPpudEVUVSG8_AgL7YmbgNg63WyW5cL_9751ZHpXzk24NA99SlUxsgqs69Pb6tsj67SH1_tF_o62gYuKnz9mOTYq7mtJ9Vsx4PLF2brpoXbOHhVjtAtuc7o?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/3TDPlVs-8njY1v8z6MwIqol7VXXEFaEakPqJ8K-_e0H141-Ia9la3LGKplviVqnOpmOhMr8CuHkeZLj39HnZLN2PMWXqql4T6zHngVGO91MFkCQYtXAoPXawZTwaQkTt5ESy6fBQvXSBzqV2T-JtJADyxq8RnGueBCxTgWandjPRBLjllViD7L_SXQnliX6P?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div><p>Along Tran Phu beach road, the evening atmosphere is always bustling yet pleasant. Walking along the beach, enjoying the cool breeze, and watching the city lights is a simple yet rewarding experience.</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/zn23eLS87ifiYuI5RK5Xin5-wQ54bxZgepmh_LmP9mJgNOTk7qrxsJPmt-U2XdlDvken3d1ic-ltThapjcf1O6EK53JTDTepxLAm02jHHvTuQpnvbSaWBVZC6H86XyVqBmjLrdTAlUIE7LufmyhmjcewIhCR8cldmGNsrQv9789NkBYjSE_Cqa4p-uHQ4DMX?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/4SXKY9yC70GAMO_Xbj2jxc_LGLVdGFL8s6Nyo1MVHiRyrRlYzcniOIyspLvsmXaafa223hfL6TPKyN_02p14P6G7hs3i3NWjnEAO9Lm42ta0UgqAgF3GD_YRcsFleFvhs4DKhYg6sirRp4opCZigRlQFVeIKjLPivaYI7LRmPz4dsDhpiRL4GztojdmVaQCq?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>This is also a great time to feel the local rhythm, visit seaside cafés, or simply sit and listen to the waves.</p><h2>🍢 Discover Culinary Delights and Night Markets</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/z3bcHYDWrt6IPoGP0ukZQRF1aROJ9EdyPsF-sFuWar66VbIsLhXHiDRe2-t5IrFyNvpTIW7Cnt_7dCs_EJonwT7CzRZPzc6SwJV_fhvfBVEa0PxQG8PwRWhbSOXD21fI_hU8oW8TMIEpjOEMgXBDArHczG_irBpseOa-O8jSgG8?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/lo0Y2EUWRxZ8-LqdBMLVIoHx1rHi9-4VAZLBokCINuYHdu_LkDyIvGyMlNrpFhu0t_-35udduR_uDkGDcdY65pQn7KiC8NRFFUn4vRIqqJNtpnObZrqSs9MplQaq2dp54JS8LQnAWAfqI8Tgw4BoS8eYGfjp8Mw6YqH_S757ZZ7Na1Qu7WU0UVJodSewBr4C?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/pMexU0m8VVI4QbieUbmTL19ZOlsAULFdquZgoQh9QApvLO8ZUBk2GRzMJ5l2x8i6bcD44mIe8R93siEtRiPGOi3xxOnshb1gOJBrCYTDFD3efifFVqEzaor4EEHLJ-Ft4EczUvD67cSUWRLJlYx7SBDx-mh7ttl0Xdm3fLN3Xr4?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/D-w8JcEGbnlQ6jfi7bpZs8R_UFZ4B-A0hq2vB_K2TLBZHGVftcNqB8barP3VZpQu-QIEarHVhYSrTAYMUhK81RWJw_iD8YhoYP-2_sbj17QXeLNEY0kHlMGFjrswSOd6SkDzRIqyzyPXZwAfrKfRBNQIyO4hAOm9AtOAGnw2VjhZrWJyKTrkP-znEbYvn8NL?purpose=fullsize\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section><div><div><div><div><div><div><p><br><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu Night Market</span> is the ideal destination for those who want to explore street food and shop for souvenirs.</p><p>From grilled seafood, grilled pork rolls to local snacks, the market offers a vibrant atmosphere rich in local flavor – perfect for an evening full of experiences.</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/K2fk3pAcA08udxiInzF4mRh0V2dJ65VUP8IZ7huXt0Y5fnTH4odik9k4yHf_VnxXSW3Z2C1u6baxHhlsG39sobPO_LXYlSkhljL2beCss22CIfZWEw6s34LKvK5TYdHoDoTuj83S7pAM5QKCeWzjI8bHk7OKJwKLteqXxe5Pjcs?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/-b0nNi8-Je9PyfZkYsO9Kx5vqq6vlMPF1wv5poOjSW4Bue0nNTnuf_ETUsz1PP27Sl-QVCgWlbKKMYijG1W7JulBO8qZeLXSeZys2eo3TI5YKaT3iJfPC7jMwE-UVA3xdQMwglh3FulbryexwbRWdDT9lCfLbSgfLYhXVfic0W01HaVZtKTupsU07FxmuUoX?purpose=fullsize\"></div><hr><h2>🍸 Rooftop Bars &amp; Nightlife – A Vũng Tàu Full of Emotions</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/L7clHtkvuFIRgTHW7UsLzg8bg43nKuIuGVXTqhkkvH2WIQRFDpDy4wWnDdqkGWeg9lYX2CKHgFd0b9gZccReDJn2MQOgnz3OTdAAswswBXqvGDIY2XW_7h4pJtH79U2XPiltkleZgs1QxT2Nnu8W1modmKQWucsBLzvTuaqvfl0?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/IAJmjv_Ryk6oxfXjoD8_8sAhq0FtSr7elic0y8NpVfJX8m8KjrGqFfgpMNTFxH5XtcJ0jln3VAPr6aJqzyq4E2VHk-ga1hmXJK0_K4OSVjWxhjdiOj44WO0jfcq3u4R_DowXU--dq8qP9mOYXmzDBXtEGts5GST-OxRsBwrfVyc9WV7NWCa548d6BtCwy5ZR?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div><p>If you love luxurious spaces, Vũng Tàu boasts many rooftop bars with stunning views of the bay.</p><p>You can enjoy cocktails, listen to music, and admire the panoramic city view from above at venues like Ruby Sky Lounge or Altitude Rooftop Bar.</p><p>This is the ideal choice for romantic evenings or inspiring gatherings.</p><h2>🎶 Relax or Enjoy the Vibrant Atmosphere</h2><p>Depending on your travel style, you can choose a quiet evening with spa, coffee, or soft music, or immerse yourself in the vibrant atmosphere at beach clubs, lounges, or seaside entertainment venues.</p><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/R1YEJxsdJowGvawWUsBSwjwSA-AIziDetadcM6DazGi0zJWzH2tR6MyFFXxTa7uu9CQKzRjCNPCWRBvdVaJ_Ohi-okuD1MqhUSH5qDzWev88qaxiGWza9IVCE_r2-bLU1RuN2IHrCgick-L_yS8eezNJayLgVsmJVk9Uzlt704A?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/QS8r6haW_YJcKOpKPpDOpev6CvzqR-WGfGg5on29DPvjNa6VbuRFHgxTzxosgHzspapHi9urTDxfenHS88BaHaNTQJdi1RRwZhxiSF5Puf_lWgY18d51UXuQM0iZu2wHzz8B6rn55KwmjW0dbmNPqL8V2bYupOTzZpYTJKC5YcCf5J9zmVS5LKfICEDclGoO?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>This diversity makes Vũng Tàu at night suitable for both guests who love relaxation and those seeking energy and new experiences.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>✨ Enjoy Vũng Tàu at Night in Your Own Style at Ruby 68</h2><p>From Ruby 68 Hotel, guests can easily explore the city at night or indulge right at the hotel.</p><p>A cocktail on the rooftop of the 9th floor, watching the lights reflecting on the bay, or relaxing at the infinity pool at night – sometimes these private moments are the most memorable experiences.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/2-6.png\" alt=\"2-6\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><strong>Vũng Tàu at night is not just about lights and music, but also unique emotions – vibrant, romantic, and full of life, much like the heartbeat of the seaside city.</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522798514-97ceb8c4f1c8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80'),
('en_US', 50, 'Why is Vũng Tàu considered Vietnam\'s beach paradise?', 'A destination where natural beauty, relaxation, and perfect harmony come together', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><p>When it comes to beach tourism in Vietnam, <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> is always the first name mentioned. Not only does it boast one of the world&#039;s most beautiful bays, but Vũng Tàu also offers a rare combination of azure seas, stunning islands, pleasant climate, rich cuisine, and a world-class resort system.</p><p>So what makes Vũng Tàu likened to Vietnam&#039;s &#039;beach paradise&#039;?</p><h2>🌊 Stunning bay with crystal-clear waters</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/nIjatiNqZZ50EhyWZHO0kIk6rScPPeZ92cBTFXhEBGB1sxiffo-Gcj6CJ-zwJ7z8Y_lGPn81ONHuGDFdY0FJ5hdGhj7_qnfJ8CIwsVeugnctz85ildo9bgglAgFd2P5AUbiHcst5UZybaTW41xwKPJ1dZgjZ1HVcCihdP9rAB7s?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/XdFRli8fjxVXEMetXUJ631ntX6HbrlbMrAh8uSg5Ow-0lvmuzeS5ZQoR_8MFBi8D-wvl6mjYcyWQkj2SSFOlQING83p-_DuPHgb5ZtX-g8KqVruhTkDvqWzwtG0QuNKCA-SkZKiRnC96noPEiAv7vubolz2OoWLVakpIuAoq9U2p28Iy5HXER__xaLZSRkPe?purpose=fullsize\"><br>&nbsp;</div><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/BbHDBXUnyhlUctADUfWokZOLb5IgDv9XxGVGnn2luvO8Gw1dDLgxzz3K0KKVsKaxsDsJmXlSWhshXIIm0cjSEbXMDoeXUpId20o0MgjS5L5szZzEiSCarpxuOq0_DypRqWFyIBcfbteNpqAm4uqXRs--O4NURyOtCQJuxyc_Gof6lb4inJC3KTEkVDWocQbP?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/9RSqaBsfPncPUEV_JffyH_uwsN4eI22LUoLqM1L_-DgnKtyR2Yn5bTRr84Hm7Fg7Jwm-Nh3Pdx2kNIPWXaMK_uJGopLdk0qHjGCa-BHsO0n11S_OJGKgu4A3rjlToL4ACVkPFJ082t40omQhp_UEtzHDv5r2vdsHqU47T_T-M8a0lksFbgpObRHi14GM8SUo?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section><div><div><div><div><div><div><p>The first thing that captivates visitors is the beauty of Back Beach Vung Tau – home to emerald waters, long sandy beaches, and a picturesque coastline.</p><p>The sea in Vũng Tàu is quite calm, with clear waters, suitable for swimming, water sports, and gentle relaxation. The sunrise over the bay or the enchanting sunset moments both offer mesmerizing beauty.</p><h2>🏝️ Beautiful islands for exploration journeys</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/oHY4MwhUFyZEOc7T20g24h2veCrSZA_Maq8qtRSvjFOTbL2kW95Od6BtBxO4uBcsweTGDJLoeyLYxxJ-aTlu1gPdlza9QosN-WPNKjZONte_DaQm04GuMy5J863P30JDVWFX8tpoiWYxD9glMAZb8KPa8TPWOaPKArsUCwSPoVw?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/YTUgZFUHz2ZOuzHP8JqhyvLRqRGJ3LtwVNlzsjjKQyAJUBbbKhkX_Xwc7pgp-d31JJ_wafhIWFttX5SU5QOthRRQ9GmmLPPqBmcLRTwj5nOw8khExhwTHNIubgYMICYDzXsMSZpA9boJvR8MbkZhb9OSWHHyZd8_4_VXX4KT2bmRxZjSKjMRgt-_gwWPT8Q-?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">Few beach destinations in Vietnam have a rich island system like Vũng Tàu.</div><p>From <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Hon Mun Island</span> with its vibrant coral world, to <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Hon Tam</span> and other peaceful islands, each island journey opens up a different experience – from scuba diving, snorkeling to relaxing amidst pristine nature.</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ICjKiALdRER-crTInKKgJ1GU_UxdeyS03o3mDFmjOpR-FmMLPxYu7pqr5uPAg5-hK7gmr9SDbAWNHDTY0qCyNA-t00rcQ-6jzmwly9fTtlZasWvmKOvy-mTs3Nmn0ImtIGeRbGCvFpHI90bPYHKujOgxlFdVjPdE2mLz3Dvufuk?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/429dyxrJL7hI-LGjALvSeHVxpxX_6osEQNMBAk2eM77g1UHpiim5sBjbcPtZzsfXZR_tfG-uQ8TFvKhNzqWINkhxkTONABodvz8lVbS2YmU76Fisn45GG9txfP9Swu2SUDmTn2Bu4QZU34KqA81N8PCdY3xQnpRnz3SWE6NjAGfwtw-s-amslLB3fDFB9c80?purpose=fullsize\"></div><h2><br>☀️ Ideal climate almost year-round</h2><p>One of Vũng Tàu&#039;s great advantages is its mostly sunny weather throughout the year. The mild climate, with little major fluctuation, allows visitors to visit almost any season.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/800;\" src=\"https://tour3dao.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/thoi-tiet-nha-trang-5.webp\" alt=\"Vũng Tàu Weather: Pocket the &#039;golden time&#039; to travel\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\"></figure><p>This is an important factor that makes Vũng Tàu a favorite destination for both short stays and long holidays.</p><hr><h2>🍤 Rich and distinctive seafood cuisine</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><figure class=\"image image_resized\" style=\"width:97.9%;\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:700/500;\" src=\"https://anfoodnhatrang.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/nha-hang-hai-san-nha-trang.jpg\" alt=\"Top 5 seafood restaurants in Vũng Tàu in 2025\" width=\"700\" height=\"500\"></figure></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><p>A beach paradise cannot be without distinctive cuisine.</p><p>From fresh seafood, grilled pork rolls, fish noodles to dishes rich in coastal flavors, Vũng Tàu offers a rich and unforgettable culinary journey.</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/6U7Gb4X_iCrMXhNYVXvthLG4JEwTZHrwJkr-uimlQcQWiz-_KvIjM1aYI5xKpGaXPjmn5YjkhtoukiUC3cmEMH_EKUDsth9kcKHguiLNzA0G_nbVB9TP7PYOLHOVBeb1EOTatAof_A8QMB7s23FmHS_pKcvwiB9gydLkf3tct3E?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/WcPJ86W9agaC5XsxPl-b3YwyPpAs5-xbwM0x5SQVNI1AgLL3OWYqEIG9cFTM1J1Xlh7WmON0i9SbomhTsu_WxxytyNDzWlLLDxbKFkl0fUEDU6_zy5pv0r1yMVwCmeIaKXb6_Mr4qC4FfKOZnq5Gkq2Ej3h-XhhagAkPsdVn_ykk-ESvCTo_WgPKO4zqdn7-?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>The cuisine here is both familiar and sophisticated enough to captivate even the most discerning diners.</p><h2>🏨 World-class seaside resorts</h2><p>What sets Vũng Tàu apart is its thriving resort ecosystem – from private bay resorts to high-end hotels right in the city center.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/4-4.png\" alt=\"4-4\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>At Ruby 68 Hotel, guests can enjoy a complete experience with sea views, infinity pools, premium spa, and exquisite dining spaces – where the beauty of Vũng Tàu is felt every day.</p><h2>✨ More than a destination, it&#039;s a lifestyle</h2><p>Vũng Tàu is not merely a place to travel.</p><p>It&#039;s where you can start your day with a sunrise over the sea, spend the afternoon exploring islands, and end with a cocktail on a rooftop watching the city lights.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/img-9762.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_9762\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p>The combination of nature, experiences, and a resort lifestyle has made Vũng Tàu transcend the concept of an ordinary destination.</p><p><strong>Vũng Tàu is called Vietnam&#039;s beach paradise not only because of its beautiful beaches, but because it gathers everything to make a vacation a memorable experience.</strong></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\">&nbsp;</div>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80'),
('en_US', 51, 'Vũng Tàu Weather Throughout the Year – The Golden Time for a Perfect Vacation', 'Choose the Perfect Season to Fully Enjoy the Beauty of the Coastal City', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><p>One of the reasons why <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> is always on the list of favorite destinations for travelers is its pleasant climate and beautiful sunshine for most of the year. With a characteristic mild weather and minimal extreme fluctuations, Vũng Tàu is almost a year-round travel destination.</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/CfHdXZI1J6jYMLIVRF2xpqEjKARAda89RDwYURoIzXgZ5I7AtcmOLLtCp85xupDwGTbMyuo86MsOFtiXXBLRgDY9xG3ZFyGYOnhuWnL-ZIYStNA7MedrhEWgtrqr4c6Xl_kzRNCxNNOKCOTbD9uDHYHpnXymR0_MyF1rkQyKpYo?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/WWmwlvae0QIqEyNYwxx2ZwC8thIq9w-jV0jq4Gsqd8U-4pHHeXheLqB1chchcfaNQ8cT_1wdt1VXnyGeyhuEnuZfRo-ltw-dKjxQ8bnD8sZ_INNncAPVrhlWY66eM06v6LVPq5dph1-KcP0Kbh2kkgNPG2REaPrCbmnsGdOkNJxFhvOsMK9P4c7q9iweHokh?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>However, each season brings its own unique charm. Understanding the weather in each period will help you choose the most suitable time for a complete vacation.</p><h2>☀️ Best Season: From January to August</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/AAmLcvS3gGFEH69YIQ_726G01mmcwG-qHoyekfT4vY0vBKZEqZ-OPOt25cKWhMF4-V48S2spl298Nnd4mNyeypJr7Vjypo3L5i_UciqpvNAfV9cwvt2VFfv1l84ur0erDrkOYpOHIjsQRy-vxTcNHUR_8BiQdkVwH1Mfu70BUcw?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/2u1lkjyboXcljIzPSOTVgOHcT5WkwAnSJgm1VrLJ8MGVvLC-NVP2Nezks0QgDy4o7oRnOa-AnJcq5qmMzlReRVuZUPRJShyN5KyTO7VAg6o4HgE2mTfvWJqUHWw52Qaeq8aA5Ok2wghzoZ5yge8L6QYLipj6ey-G1R3aVCDSsZwlI_OD6wkpvu0XbRSvyyAR?purpose=fullsize\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>This is considered the golden time to visit Vũng Tàu.</div><p>From the beginning of the year until around August, the weather is mainly sunny, the sea is calm, the water is clear, and it is very favorable for outdoor activities such as swimming, island tours, diving, or experiencing water sports.</p><p>In particular, the period from March to June is often rated by many visitors as the most beautiful – pleasant sunshine, little rain, and vibrant sea scenery.</p><h2>🌊 Ideal Season for Exploring Islands</h2><p>If you plan to take an island tour or go diving at <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Hon Mun Island</span> , the period from April to July is very ideal.</p><p>This is when the sea is usually calm, underwater visibility is good, suitable for snorkeling and scuba diving. Those who love exploring the ocean or experiencing a canoe trip to the island should prioritize this period.</p><h2>🌤️ September to November – Quiet Off-Peak Season</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/AIrqzwAMMIFLPB1l1aPjKmKu5AaSGMjy9dWi9Qx_vu4S7CK-z9Yw5h4byNIqFFHHXfYHlVXVNcE0aKkQRXV0rYvBLMFwrfXIuVoHolSj9T_OyPENx2ce2kT8MMrPKzVnSnO_LkI-IdX94M6jg3MwGc91j_dBKBtCqL9pltqNjFw?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ynOgwk6VBtZlGuMZBmyH-QmQFMeV3q5lm9ruSMqd2ctQt4X1J0wsuEFzQveCVZ8KBXlpD52V7LdKpROIQ6muUyxZKU88Ue1HRDbXmAmpUw-BC01Q-5hHF1txtUYclEikpHCr-B_JZLdtSQKhnneYOeITVzaMgvz5L4W7_8l9kXrLIiiIlx3EFj6x-4YmRP9B?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/CSiB3P5LuqYs2A-MYQPqYUHCjM3ApdyPLKwGysBVtfqElJBNPjBHWh4ysVQouqhaW-RRXs1DNTkohr5QFKKC8sZnUGwHXC7p7DoX2xDUs-UfWU6tpnn6RAURPTK_9FCuulmUfXyh3s2ohqkPQhUZLrjWE2MdPqwVWiosINoMdCbqpx9h8wKQfW_d0NDIr6Ik?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/QpGjhdV595PZHDUig4uMMfHd9RHfpF4uvD865u7m5IarQx7lb7IlQrhxU08tMj0YbNP5QSHYWpdSaYDtmGhvnUAjsXtXDWg9HUKYJbEvEobhUC9A7QI83ldTo_rAK80DCc5x-gT3D2BE2uOlOqzu3sMx-OzFfp28oPpWkHpJcIdscMYLiKfMUTFF3xuTO2eO?purpose=fullsize\"><br>&nbsp;</div><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><p>From September to November, Vũng Tàu may experience scattered showers, especially towards the end of the year. However, this is also a time when the city is quieter, less crowded, and suitable for travelers who love a relaxing space.</p><p>If you prioritize relaxation over a packed exploration schedule, this can still be a time worth considering.</p><h2>🌴 December to February – Pleasant for Relaxation</h2><p>The end of the year and the beginning of the next year bring cool, pleasant weather, suitable for gentle vacations.</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/rrShhIPWgZSM22jPMz5-w4BqVvF76fosv0SPMx3bFSnG3s9NE4YxLlr6hzXOTg9g4xgg4mGgsvXJKg5IXcEWCanhNX5pjPFFimJkCiTj4hX7DhU6o_tLou6yKbw7ugvX_GojBDjdDwi2oQ7-erFhlM9XRpDMQxcEsNNkJAcL6yJ2-mwhhCS0ytd365501A9J?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/NsymA9tykbOEwp52WyTAFMK1FGdOxfrwIPvDRpGZFbL8AurDj1qzgbfKONTEwVP3Y6Y7XPtQ__ljtb9QB35Mf2mL8HyZYiCWhWrutvg_hj67aZD2-fgt95rER3Ubz2Yl9S9cywZx5Q3yHtC_Gw7-UPU0ov5oMQ8IUVw4OKZdXnCbUottd3mmOCAkr-oP2hrs?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>This is the ideal time if you want to enjoy the beach, spa, cuisine, and premium relaxation experiences without focusing too much on island activities.</p><p>At Ruby 68 Hotel, this is also a period many guests choose for their year-end vacation or to welcome the New Year by the sea.</p><h2>✨ So, when is the best time to visit Vũng Tàu?</h2><p>Depending on your travel style, you can choose:</p><ul><li><strong>March – June:</strong> best for beaches, islands, ideal weather</li><li><strong>April – July:</strong> ideal for diving and island tours</li><li><strong>September – November:</strong> suitable for quiet relaxation, less crowded</li><li><strong>December – February:</strong> perfect for a relaxing year-end vacation</li></ul><p>If you want to balance beautiful weather, clear seas, and a complete experience, <strong>March to June</strong> is often considered the “golden time.”</p><h2>🌅 A Perfect Vacation Begins with Choosing the Right Time</h2><p>Beautiful weather can completely change the quality of a trip.</p><p>By choosing the right season, you will enjoy bluer seas, smoother journeys, and more memorable moments – from sunrises over the bay, island trips to relaxing afternoons by the infinity pool.</p><p><strong>Vũng Tàu is beautiful almost year-round, but choosing the right time will turn a trip into a truly complete vacation.</strong></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\">&nbsp;</div>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506929562872-bb421503ef21?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80');
INSERT INTO `posts_translations` (`lang_code`, `posts_id`, `name`, `description`, `content`, `image`) VALUES
('en_US', 52, 'Culture & People of Vũng Tàu', 'The beauty comes not only from the sea, but also from the rhythm of life and the people here.', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><p>Mention <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> , and many immediately think of blue seas, white sands, and sun-drenched holidays. However, what draws many visitors back is not just the beautiful scenery, but also the distinctive culture and the unique friendliness of the local people.</p><p>Vũng Tàu is not just a tourist destination, but a place where the culture of the sea, local traditions, and modern life intersect.</p><h2>🌊 Culture Tied to the Sea</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/960;\" src=\"https://newlifetravel.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Cau-ngu-le-hoi-o-nha-trang.webp\" alt=\"Explore Vũng Tàu Culture | Unique Heritage &amp; Sea Festivals\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\"></figure><p>The sea is not just a landscape, but an integral part of the life and culture of the people of Vũng Tàu.</p><p>From traditional fishing villages, seafood catching to daily routines linked with the sea, everything reflects the deep connection between the people and the ocean.</p><p>This maritime culture also fosters a lifestyle that is open, sincere, and welcoming among the locals.</p><h2>🛕 Long-standing Cultural Intersections</h2><p>Vũng Tàu embodies many layers of culture accumulated over time.</p><p>From ancient Cham heritage like <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Bạch Dinh</span> , to spiritual sites like <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Niet Ban Tinh Xa Pagoda</span> or <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu Stone Church</span> , the city showcases a harmonious blend of beliefs, architecture, and cultural life.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/800;\" src=\"https://tour3dao.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/van-hoa-nha-trang-4-1.webp\" alt=\"The distinctive features of Vũng Tàu&#039;s culture and 9 unique festivals\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\"></figure><p>This is what gives Vũng Tàu a depth that goes beyond a typical seaside destination.</p><hr><h2>😊 The People of Vũng Tàu – Gentle and Hospitable</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/CANCotPCk7hx0N_c9cIS_0ruyuiqsZ0biA7r2tuJDSxicwwsFJJwGjC7uoxqDw2zp8bF_NhnRRhwkFm5_74hdxXjCTM3E7l3rZlEyupWdhWt9N-GjHBWP88IVZUVa8EDX90JhhygUMLs4vGMZNwI_6CVBHlD8KimZ9Pmxr_eTXk?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/AQov-3TcdbhPDD0Anq6qagk0U4mGIhBb3O9PfnoAtersVUvbeR39lhpIgGgJKs-1ptAzHRoChxZnaLYPsUMpY3led5DihIIsyQBJeAZnwYowo59MAPYmFUBTnxVPZ9E2XJ_70mIJ40aFb8ke63Inufz3xc2w_AbNrId887F64cZV5HBLUFeuZd6bO_1wFsj-?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/1Jk6WyymuyNDBmwEmMPPtMr6P1QZ3ZGvNqC6q3QdWmauOdx6_4FqabdOBotwuU1ibf9yf7C2DTNRd4O070z9geaFAiuSweCeyKH1vWvnmLVYx5i2YGikpOWfMEWtAOGOg07hCG-kvQe-n62qUeKpS2my6Yg6q0QPHM0SipyfXS0?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/enOgr10eTaYJFZp2Vh1yEU16IHArp5dYU34QnvGqjbp47uhyXT5tWFwu4mXpJ47x0UDmnroQNFNEtcINApy71F7I-RGuMcUm6iSkHe7TH5NCJArEDZjkVNFpZAnkL8AlrxOFgDS1QBwOMJc0inXZM0rE3x73VBCCCH4DPM_vxP-V29dTF1hNG7-x7O10EGNq?purpose=fullsize\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><p>One of the things visitors often mention after their trip is the amiability of the people of Vũng Tàu.</p><p>From taxi drivers, market vendors, to fishermen or service staff, you can easily feel the sincerity, gentleness, and hospitality in their interactions.</p><p>These simple things often leave a longer-lasting impression than the beautiful scenery.</p><h2>🍤 Culture Expressed Through Cuisine and Lifestyle</h2><p>Local cuisine is also an important part of the culture.</p><p>From fish noodle soup, grilled pork rolls to fresh seafood, each dish reflects a lifestyle connected to the sea and the sophistication in Central Vietnam&#039;s palate.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:2560/1780;\" src=\"https://baokhanhhoa.vn/file/e7837c02857c8ca30185a8c39b582c03/032024/hinh_3_20240322111703.jpg\" alt=\"Culinary Competition “Vũng Tàu Then and Now” - Bà Rịa - Vũng Tàu Online\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1780\"></figure><p>Moreover, the pace of life in Vũng Tàu strikes a special balance – dynamic enough to attract tourists, yet slow enough to create a sense of relaxation.</p><h2>✨ Experience Vũng Tàu More Fully by Embracing Local Culture</h2><p>A trip becomes more meaningful when it goes beyond sightseeing to truly embrace the spirit of the destination.</p><p>From Ruby 68 Hotel, guests can easily connect with both the natural beauty and the cultural depth of the city – from heritage sites, local markets to the daily coastal lifestyle.</p><p>This is how to understand Vũng Tàu not just by sight, but by emotion.</p><p><strong>Vũng Tàu is beautiful not only for its blue seas but also for its rich cultural identity and the people who make every journey warm and memorable.</strong></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\">&nbsp;</div>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583417319070-4a69db38a482?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80'),
('en_US', 53, '🍾 PREMIUM BEEF BUFFET NIGHT – AN UNMISSABLE EXPERIENCE FOR THE 30/4 - 1/5 HOLIDAY', 'At Ruby 68 Hotel, the gala buffet night celebrating the grand festival is not merely a meal, but a journey to explore culinary excellence with premium cuts of beef selected from Australia, the USA, Canada, and Japan.', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:\'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><div style=\"font-family:inherit;\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;height:16px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;text-align:inherit;text-decoration:none;width:16px;\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t19/1/16/1f37e.png\" alt=\"🍾\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span> PREMIUM BEEF BUFFET NIGHT – AN UNMISSABLE EXPERIENCE FOR THE 30/4 - 1/5 HOLIDAY</div></div><div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:\'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0.5em;word-spacing:0px;\"><div style=\"font-family:inherit;\">At Ruby 68 Hotel, the buffet night celebrating the grand holiday is not merely a meal, but a culinary journey featuring exquisite beef selections sourced from Australia, the USA, Canada, and Japan.</div></div><div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:\'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0.5em;word-spacing:0px;\"><div style=\"font-family:inherit;\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;height:16px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;text-align:inherit;text-decoration:none;width:16px;\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf4/1/16/2728.png\" alt=\"✨\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span> From succulent Hokubee ribeye, authentic Australian tenderloin, to flavorful T-bone steaks, all are expertly prepared and served directly at your table – offering a personalized and sophisticated experience.</div><div style=\"font-family:inherit;\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;height:16px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;text-align:inherit;text-decoration:none;width:16px;\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf4/1/16/2728.png\" alt=\"✨\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span> Whole roasted veal leg &amp; oven-baked Australian lamb leg</div><div style=\"font-family:inherit;\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;height:16px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;text-align:inherit;text-decoration:none;width:16px;\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf4/1/16/2728.png\" alt=\"✨\" width=\"16\"