op-brightness-75\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div><p><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> is renowned as Vietnam&#039;s beach paradise, boasting a long coastline, crystal-clear waters, and numerous stunning beaches. Each beach here has its own unique charm – from vibrant and bustling to untouched and serene – catering to various travel styles.</p><p>If you are planning your trip, here are the 5 most beautiful beaches in Vũng Tàu that you should not miss.</p><hr><h2>🌊 1. Tran Phu Beach – The Vibrant Heart of the City</h2></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/jYt6ai71Ft0dMckZZgUvoiZ256i3MZtF0UONwUjELLib6TRdvzrYd76_UhHThJpK3Nh46Vwxrszp2wRyY5SSv9MjYRuZbsQ9fVCm9kWpHIUwow0yCeYJD_I0Es9Xos2MM_WJUuvoG_JFtejxaWekmivTgpDywQgA9ie72Zw4TSDamYBDYnYTfP0YxwSY9u9J?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/bn6GSQzrD7ET5U1AghKzfXfOZzI89KGBMzsw2oNXs3PiD8tDQAHGnd05UfE-fm6L3fwRBalWg7wkhDWUp48kMVeNXL_GgXwn46G30dc5T8mR3PniGUyyfbKRkv5dHTCFat1pnT8r6Nt1bIh1JIAQWCtzt0ZUeYX8Y1EAsyvuQapTezmS3PXq0LMKOe1yVvGT?purpose=fullsize\"></div><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\"><div class=\"shrink-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">7</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><p>Tran Phu Beach is an icon of Vũng Tàu with its long sandy shore, blue waters, and central city location.</p><p>This place is perfect for swimming, strolling, engaging in water sports, or exploring the array of restaurants, cafés, and beach clubs along the coast.</p><h2>🏝️ 2. Bai Dai – Pristine and Relaxing</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/mqB9LLb-BHJKCpF4Tmewt_AORFuWoBCIlDUeJko70om80q6gbDlckfQgWB8VNeK4hgdrHBg1S-5_UyYEka0SsQdPGE3M_3eZPhaKj48XwGwGRzN0W8Y1cLPefy8Wfcn4uvlN94OyNIFZs8FiiZIGYgh6mvajzmNJcYd0Cs5nDAs?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/_v81zu4ZlE638CH7TwECyRli-pjBWuyTWE8jYTRW05Zo8Yo5zmMci-QJcEAJr-GgPR17cxan7aEEns9a5GtFTwxu7Wmf2XWu8VXnxR8Y0C99WWUP0f2RtKCNWlcczGUlbet-nQn2O53m-cZbTZsAyRQh06OQVRG9tkpyDUSsxN_lLXU3o-gUu8XjLCB3LQTb?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><d