('en_US', 55, 'Guide to Traveling from Long Thành Airport to Vũng Tàu', 'Effortlessly begin your perfect vacation from the very first journey', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/_uV7nDK-08rWrGY2al-GkgLwH-XR0t1FNjr6RPz7OWZhRdbKZXEvDAXIyZPknaNQSmhlaVgE_bwz1MccdL1QcctnEMZOm6V8cwQ6RjFjGENd5-HTi5guopaPkP6ewVOQAvdq3a6EUyb1WYhqAW8nHYS4iHxXL5rsp-fXfVfrPaY?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Ehy6Kqpj2PPcCFz6hncook9-8psziCNKGd5W_RX354Y0bHYKO5x0r_Fgwxt7TN8YDVa1wh05ZOB4U8zsAq5uO6uqFVQFp0otOtvfmShytO7SgWXneDJbb6-_wvlviZTkayH459599o5ChkqBDHfD8TjunbgOeCC5fhEzJ0DBKC83I-R7ZmYYy626W3_5Qi4_?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div><p><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Long Thành International Airport</span> is the primary air gateway for travelers to the coastal city of <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> . The airport is approximately 35 km from the city center, equivalent to a 40–50 minute journey depending on the mode of transport and traffic conditions.</p><p>To make your resort experience more convenient and comfortable, here are the popular ways to travel from Long Thành Airport to Vũng Tàu.</p><hr><h2>🚖 Taxi – Quick and Convenient</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/PV2ysdcAS6L_Nazjqd4jEfqzZ33eoW7YYoinS2nyc93fythwTam_HWoAFcl7PDoNQeZpHMwiCNTktFnZpx9u-NIkAsbyNH4_T3drk0syB8JQlDvjW6Ip58vfEuXRdREiEIzmo9nSiaNf99tmckyebRFUeipNhaf3ZMqcZbeq3Vo?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/stjhhQpQyLntcfBF8_5--SA4E95gbxKRrLyctUaAv9XEaHRT8i1F12EyhoGpXWomIKqhR6kUVlOXSW8kzIvPCWlBonAlvFZmlt5XUxsIN4RBOFdX4jx21t39EN-k7YBz0yVkxvZ5oyxQKjhKyTXL_tHcuw8TzZR7jGwvHd6MFNIRfFgfI1edEw_Pl2_JWCSX?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>Taxi is the most popular choice, suitable for families, groups of friends, or travelers with a lot of luggage.</p><p>You can easily catch a taxi right at the airport&#039;s arrival hall. Several reputable taxi companies operate in this area, usually offering transparent pricing and readily available vehicles.</p><p><strong>Travel time:</strong> approximately 40–50 minutes<br><strong>Estimated cost:</strong> from 250,000 – 400,000 VND/one way</p><p>The biggest advantage is the speed, privacy, and no waiting time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>🚐 Hotel Shuttle – Comfortable and Prestigious</h2><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:800/533;\" src=\"https://bookinglimo.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Xe-limousine-S%C3%A0i-G%C3%B2n-%C4%91i-V%C5%A9ng-T%C3%A0u-Limo24h.jpg\" alt=\"Top 3 Best Limousine Services from Vung Tau to Saigon | Booking Limo\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\"></figure><p>Many 4–3 star hotels in Vũng Tàu offer private airport shuttle services.</p><p>If staying at Ruby 68 Hotel, guests can pre-book a private car service for direct pick-up, luggage assistance, and convenient transfer to the hotel.</p><p>This is an ideal choice for luxury resort guests, families, or business travelers seeking privacy.</p><hr><h2>🚌 Airport Bus – Cost-effective</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/HqdLfyh6xnzKe9KYqi3d9VSqSq-113_2jtrO8cCE4OI9ZANuf_e2AEunmAzHAUNjbmtf6QwpMpsGLhG-dgdSKralBYzk1qrdMnkX66I6-vHoTIPIjtJUi0VEbwxw9_Fcxg5DshZX1deIn2ZZUHa6J0broXAKsRw1AHLyWSijS2o?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/XxNlCYje2N-eKAmSj23cJ7F9eFGj6cFiOLbJH1mCgNmA_hBIzDCqCLjpvIFZ-Ale-04XK2ulUmoiD8rQT5tSd7OoLCKPMNjAUXB1Q7lTc-GujIhSeLbEf5bSM3Y-8XcYlrjAVGoAbnfs8lmZGFcY730NwanztyWuyEYZCOaAVGegKrGTeRGueRfB8d3NVM2R?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/9qsc3b7O_VWAYm-e-ge6IYbhZue-TktV02l3MKpoT93nCBQmsx5zC58D4_cTX4xonXFIBbKZ-3dgMin3_g6zGXJptitodBWFbee_909sA5KKBCsx2FQd_qgAwV35eveBchbN5rUoP9DHOddFYFvIIjox2jQT2hI712O6cnUArHA?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/q0oGxfPkFz4gWS9-oGVTNctf3p7oYFY_EsQ-kZX3R7-cFAXmwMziaueWPjdhMcrQ5buyHwZSV6RpmrNOTxlfA4djob9Adg4ESXXjylr4x-fBuqWLs3YfeijnRqgmcdPHNFILLkzFpPV1LcxQ3i1tm2FyJS-UR8W-6wsGlYL9Cwp2lSSEIHKbtCgo46qK--PH?purpose=fullsize\"></div><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\"><div class=\"shrink-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">6</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><p>The bus is an economical choice for solo travelers or those with little luggage.</p><p>Buses usually run on a fixed schedule and take passengers to the city center area.</p><p><strong>Travel time:</strong> approximately 50–60 minutes<br><strong>Estimated cost:</strong> approximately 50,000 – 70,000 VND/person</p><p>However, you may need to take an additional taxi or ride-hailing service from the stop to your hotel.</p><h2>🚘 Ride-hailing / Private Car Rental</h2><p>Ride-hailing apps like <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Grab</span> or private car rental services are also quite popular.</p><p>If you want to control your schedule or combine sightseeing on the way to the city, renting a private car is a flexible option.</p><p>Costs may vary depending on the time of day and type of vehicle.</p><h2>✨ Suitable Options for Every Need</h2><p>Depending on your travel style, you can choose the appropriate mode of transport:</p><ul><li><strong>Quick &amp; Private:</strong> Taxi or Private Car</li><li><strong>Luxury Resort Experience:</strong> Hotel Shuttle</li><li><strong>Cost-effective:</strong> Airport Bus</li><li><strong>Flexible:</strong> Ride-hailing / Private Car Rental</li></ul><p>Choosing the right option from the moment you land will help your vacation start smoothly and comfortably.</p><h2>🌊 Welcome to the Coastal City</h2><p>From Long Thành Airport, the journey to Vũng Tàu will take you along a stunning coastal road – where you can feel the resort atmosphere from the very first moments.</p><p>And upon arrival at Ruby 68 Hotel, a complete vacation with an infinity pool, premium spa, and bay view awaits you.</p><p><strong>A convenient journey is always the perfect start to a memorable vacation in Vũng Tàu.</strong></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\">&nbsp;</div>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631049307264-da0ec9d70304?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80'),
('en_US', 56, 'Experience the Stunning Sunrise in Vũng Tàu', 'Welcome the first rays of sunshine on one of the most beautiful bays in Vietnam', '<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/vUnr5dRepQq4quoWtIsMjTtXBp9F8Psd8TnJ7RO_Y5ttUmWk01RNgJnsXaRX-rY5a3umZQqVX9BF_KlxpEZ1yIqwFopziTZgZtNM97uyWFQZwObBbHz7osSnwYrcOv5X9LJ2sMmWwZ_88h0BdTHBe8h1iFKpuHar8EOE0gKLf6Pl0TCBFjn9xqTo3jpw82AO?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/_u2CWRsmOtLciVSLdjJiJ7laucPoC-ZUexO8QhXE2bxOUxiuHmseF49d-VF9P57tf1fKulUO3eGQMEbxszEaOp_SBaCVm4IMD3x6h-WX2C7qfjdl6xkY_AXnLQ6teRY1sS4LXjPElbGMYBOzOcof7R0qS3zI0biHxF3nbaBkRxU9E4bMnygxtpvLQirXA3jx?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> is not only renowned for its azure seas and sun-drenched holidays, but also as one of the most beautiful places to witness the sunrise in Vietnam. As the sun gradually rises from the sea, painting the sky with vibrant shades of orange, pink, and gold, the entire city awakens in a scene full of emotion.</p><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/518x9mF7cO6ISxbh_P4d_v_yWeCOfr0ogUYH4a0m3XyRRnrPKYkH49JfWDudarsZVZhgrComqySn8Ct1m7bAjN8x0BoZ65Rs7iA2R4gPrrB3F6D8eT7uxVll0BAYta14FXq--VL-74DQHPQO8ZvLAEp-JXLRAQ_8teHdYVW3-aJ7dDtQvYWIsk1REMG85jlc?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/UFcXcYoZKWH1MTul_VF7KT3oPevLdyVHPiIhiA_URJel-bMlt8-oHMELg5m09Mcrivs11RIm4pOhxdDwoK79GPFDvVHWEuYuGvx1NuvjJ3MDNFJHFfOmKUqWfNByjY2KTDo9H1Jf9Rm-Ftb665iOJkLfEXcZzzbhfpCahZrCX5pXA36wyh6udjrhwzE4wYja?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>If you wish to fully enjoy this special moment, here are some useful tips for you.</p><h2>🌅 Ideal Time to Watch the Sunrise</h2><p>The sunrise in Vũng Tàu typically occurs around <strong>5:15 – 5:45 AM</strong>, depending on the season.</p><p>To secure a prime spot and fully enjoy the transition between night and day, it is recommended to arrive about 15–20 minutes early.</p><p>The period from March to August usually features clear skies and few clouds, making it ideal for sunrise watching.</p><h2>📍 Best Spots to Watch the Sunrise</h2><h3>🌊 Tran Phu Beach</h3><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ykR6q0Ar-Iatv5jaOVNvlHOKFErXIRX9_pWAQw-JUDgyNYrux6DYtpumt-AIJN281_vAmbQ3r4CPmtk3tLs8DOPZtEZ0KX5RM1966xcGeAB1Ev3rwk8vlmRI6m_uBdEq5vLNwjijboR2svoJQPsXniUhtjxUWFTKChEmJrhlMw6mFRCAhMJmBtI_JvxlCJ5M?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Wmu924VDDlH1dRpSP9yv5bjA_x_OfYspNLvi54Zom5vJa_zkE86bJFB2POxsZZc_CnqWnBMWFilL37KsOPNkpYxA_DRnTZRRiGYCIZd5KOYdMnZu1Nff2ZvbyNGMME0jQwi0USAwwK88ML6OJD2NIpKiDdHcfZiNHFMI92uTkFGIDuQg8KTYDmi5Xg3Stlm_?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/vw86Y-7Qe3ENXW-aMlqu8t-DFx3tDm78APE7vU3ryDCphmTpn55LYe9ScJiihziiHlHw8digsYHDRyf2grwb6PJnCEOzuxba0-E4qAN_5v_KzV4WZjVnRQTUXvrePtsmPmFZ5lnfnUVyfXYMsjsOi-iwGrczgelqNItpIWB4aGHN18QxAtj5G1pqxV6KvpuG?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/zK-qpkf_0QWnXF_iGwSSToH514ktxkpG2RpCSl2pOFlBQDdHCf3F6wA9X_VWw2k0JMjYZEMgct8_TMVhE8hQAAoCPGfMfPNJp8irfWJt7Jrka-sXnYQP7vVXvTSozk0KyXpKzuoTDWIG_bsJxGTptSMw0XxcbH-en7YDa7YyW3HGuv3Cm_1tY2jJRILLSxbs?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p>Tran Phu Beach is the most accessible location for watching the sunrise.</p><p>You can stroll along the sand while experiencing the morning rhythm of the locals with activities like exercise, jogging, and early swimming.</p><h3> Hon Chong</h3><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/M8s32Hdguzo2ouqJStfMWwGFNWIZjWuCpiGorsNXnnKKtf5jlzohZ1CUxsvcWR2RcCXf3ApqTsitN9TcGeaIW4iGzDHrg7YCgOpJ_8HjrR2XkDHFEyRGkxIMZQTt04H9Awj-6W8PxA87pgCJ4I50xVHhbe9mtgd2p8EMpdzDjOtiCOeXqG0Q-YqJY-ZuVUKs?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/etx86K6rUVJi4TIDFItK5JQ3vkDyRnMzJcMgTm5_kQnIdHGOPitz6Ola7eZyvWajNrDxBUG56jAEB68VlUoieKZWpA8I0mazryunxKH5iq_IzwlTqqnuMOrYJwwlyq8xcIEv--hmHECfmWQPGFoin8AdXXOe8E1YZgpskOYpuw5BXPfXznQkNkxw0Nu6t4Au?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Hon Chong</span> offers a higher and wider perspective, where you can watch the sun rise over the sea amidst an impressive setting of rocks and waves.</p><h3>🏨 Infinity Pool or Hotel Room Balcony</h3><p>For those who appreciate privacy and a premium resort experience, watching the sunrise from the infinity pool or a sea-view balcony at Ruby 68 Hotel is an emotional choice.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/17-blue-ocean-bar.jpg\" alt=\"17 Ruby Ocean Bar\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p>A morning coffee, sea breeze, and the first rays of sunlight will make that moment more memorable than ever.</p><h2>📸 Tips for the Best Experience</h2><ul><li>Prepare your camera or phone ready to capture the moment</li><li>Wear light, comfortable clothing as the morning is quite pleasant</li><li>For beautiful photos, choose light-colored or gentle-style outfits</li><li>Check the weather forecast beforehand to avoid cloudy or rainy days</li></ul><h2>✨ Start Your Day in the Most Complete Way</h2><p>Watching the sunrise is not only a visual delight but also a way to start your day full of energy and peace.</p><p>After that moment, you can continue to enjoy a sea-view buffet breakfast, relax by the pool, or begin your journey to explore the city.</p><p><strong>The sunrise in Vũng Tàu is not just a moment of the sun rising – it is a feeling of peace and completeness that you will want to experience at least once in your life.</strong></p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582719478250-c89cae4dc85b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80'),
('en_US', 57, 'Diving in Vũng Tàu: Top 5 Must-Visit Destinations', 'Discover the vibrant ocean world at one of the most beautiful bays in Vietnam.', '<p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/QOS1mHx9IMYU5tYYpJyxy7s9AvpvPsHdUU6fLMhet_G56gw2XE3HJmqLDZHmKdQeTwZ--Uj5AMA98a2M8fkEZuaKpvR-EiUT59dmWlaP0D-fa_9KnhyWx5TAVyej81FgpfxAlUcvA4snuPr-D8m5JTHUf1lhde5OXP4Qq9gALak?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Aw15i7EC9tBPPl6dBjTL5UJEaC5EX54LWHiyK31H4Nsbv0MFMzSmVfeZOuS0uNBs4v8e8tXj6MxjzuJ3QzDzLtgkUpMsxV9mJOpXf0SxevQfW1ONbmaUP6nRcZSk-wkcc13qOlnJIYYeueNS1RuRP1Py43X4VVVf7lP92mw35WVIRZQwyNqXJIcqG15hOgIA?purpose=fullsize\"></div><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><p><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> is renowned as Vietnam&#039;s paradise of islands, not only for its beautiful beaches but also for its rich marine ecosystem and vibrant coral reefs. With crystal-clear waters and numerous famous diving spots, Vũng Tàu is the ideal destination for both snorkeling and scuba diving.</p><p>Here are the 5 most beautiful diving locations in Vũng Tàu that you should not miss.</p><hr><h2>🤿 1. <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Mun Island</span> – The most famous diving paradise</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/LjnlJV_r6HbnmbgFJdA3WZeBXv6_kCchjvTuY8AuU5oGeH7xYJRXNO2Kzis8-3CmeFwEiV_N5-Fd72BKS0XnVJJNZ_8RsXpWqRhkghCGDy_C26p2fApQrj-MjxMy6_Z1sQ732QSv2x9xwujYgLsURFL1hgGighXpe3m2bkU-Wmo?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/-hyM4eQjffHDsFVUCPJsAuzY_FwOS7c6nqeBX7k7r0_n_ZlMp7_4J9YLbdpwgcc_F_mZQmwqt28DUpzE_olkc_pf5MhrVzpVl39CBGrQrIIMNjj_Bu8B_Z5b4Bz882BuIKDZnZfqWmI46AIdmMySYyp_XxuZ1oCuzIK9xEN2GQdGjY-9ja1WJabXY1jCLuAa?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div><p>Mun Island is Vietnam&#039;s first marine reserve and the most renowned diving spot in Vũng Tàu.</p><p>This area boasts one of the most diverse coral ecosystems in Southeast Asia, along with hundreds of colorful tropical fish species. The clear waters and good visibility enhance the diving experience, making it more vivid and impressive.</p><h2>🐠 2. <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Mot Island</span> – An ideal snorkeling spot</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/sg_Uj6Ww38StTKABgJS55TDM8gVdN31gv4MB1LnKkpQo9IsafJjeKh8Safuj95fHQrDTHvTXa1Rw9pkMCgChvFuDnu9qfYIW9_gL2W1HwMHtWt5CxRqOS5lZOWU3L3E0aScLRWJhfNOI4Gt_Tx6-GaDHG3dztpkb85TP84C5yoY?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/72fU8wK5OK5vJivhQwiLjo1WP7bv_deOpl4jJKsdIgKTlIk8q347nD21WOcD_CGRmlRW3xKSvOts7s9L6wV5jJmGcSKO8LQnpSCM43x1oaMVEK9qn-EwNqdQWfGiXSpSfSpu51Lup51HvjdJJonIL08Os7-TGqGA4dSJUOZm9pTUC9L8AOuIMzPvKfQ3RtLH?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><p><br>Mot Island features shallow and calm waters, making it perfect for beginners or visitors who enjoy snorkeling.</p><p>You can easily see corals and fish swimming close to the surface.</p><h2>🌊 3. <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Tam Island</span> – Diving combined with relaxation</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/0aUqp2gM3MO77N_87FDzukl6JnQapKcqV4j2OM47ErRTUxempgR9-GeShGAKayv_zVMyx7-bIi20-hJoVL5q6SOMoICwqJFqlZuCYrZDP8rU_HVdYrdOUAWEj3fP8wnIxANHuXOHbd9tfpMbl2f8LYulqSS52b95IBpi1LNKQ08?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/JPOnIukRD6iESZwVwwAdpNkGfhgJ0BCm4Ej8mMj0d7XLo6UgaR9wLGQNqKkcTZXzkub7Cljmi0tDggHNAsC_O8w4mFeN0Zu8u5l_J5vIDViAU8EwLP5NZUd5Jo36K4pJpjjz7QZdLDWt8w_5D6W7Zn3JouwOW0DM1tWMoEA655K0C34tuD-PgA3phTGtzc06?purpose=fullsize\">Tam Island is not only famous for its premium relaxation but also offers exciting diving activities.</div><p>This is an ideal choice for families or couples looking to combine relaxation with ocean exploration.</p><hr><h2>🏝️ 4. <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Monkey Island</span> – A diverse island experience</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/od6CXxZL9EeENuHehEvHWV3tiqkzFH78nm61vaLbTGiq8JGLcw0aIL6_sCsScMaEeKA8GXtaC8cGxzIdtnVyYAOMUORXH9uW62jkMzrvPAimW7IlCol0pz8v8V9beKTF73A687VOTErrcevun5MvYGusk3GO31eb8a5ot7Ii81k?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/-x53NUN6QaXVIO-J2k2dqkU0z6D-pX-WUvB6b5jLPioOfOrI1RVhtqBbNg_cl8JUDu1a2zJ1ghGGRFDk7lw6tYFq_4w2wTnzUSnvOEa87bIhb-Qw5DXQaeyDBitOGT-r8RR7xXWgRuEEhcITdOdns1qXidbYYoC2IIigNvfBM-QFSIWSc_E-1wKKgZrXsIwK?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>The area around Monkey Island has beautiful waters and many tours that combine sightseeing, diving, and day-time fun.</p><p>This is an exciting option for those who want to experience multiple activities in one journey.</p><h2>🐢 5. <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Tranh Beach</span> – Stunning crystal-clear waters</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ZChLFVpl0zumXhZpjzBbDt7LFQAF8TSmx6m2duqdyOi1-mLZhd6vxWWTK2fcYAyw5_7OLWMObi5fBgqyPYYzCoXQ2cbM3xWLrVtjVAcmXPgRwaB23K1ok4wl871u0-6_nUwGr_iJB3by1Qu1_ZnnCeSYTKa0TYJFWsmgb61S13o?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/b6dfL43UcT8jF9wNE-i0IYcFr3iLkoQqvyeBqqSsaESR4H6jRERaoo2Y6b6YKvJpYWr1Xky4pt7z9r1uHR4lZmDYt8aNfM5PWq5AZYWRKPwaZj_XafjQ4pDDQLIHWbyh1sjK5GsfF486CenvBM3mWy4XLI0mLsj3nqQV0n92hoR38v8MalWRYES41QpUADig?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div><p>Tranh Beach is famous for its clear waters and gentle waves, making it very suitable for snorkeling and water sports.</p><p>The surroundings here are also very beautiful for relaxing after diving.</p><h2>✨ Enjoy a complete ocean journey at Ruby 68</h2><p>From Ruby 68 Hotel, guests can easily book diving tours or arrange an itinerary to explore the islands.</p><p>After a day immersed in the ocean, return to enjoy the infinity pool, rejuvenating spa, and exquisite dinner overlooking the bay.</p><p><strong>Diving in Vũng Tàu is not just a recreational activity, but a journey to explore the wondrous world beneath the ocean.</strong></p></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"pointer-events-none translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom) R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars min-h-(--gutter-remaining-height,0px) group-data-stream-active/scroll-root:h-[calc(var(--thread-response-height)-16*var(--spacing))]\">&nbsp;</div>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540518614846-7eded433c457?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80'),
('en_US', 58, 'What to Know for Your First Trip to Vũng Tàu?', 'The secret to an unforgettable and complete journey in the coastal city.', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/8mR9Gm1l3wrMznUJJqXl6Y8Jwn8cx7eiEbm3_vC_nI7JzZcxJarqI83XgirktkF28pXAIVKyKAgL9ILHdxch_3IUzZuSbvOpqIUhkn5W_mAJQwBh8HO1WMEmWSbVnc2UtIjshxlkZ742Z8aEW-6TeHgvxTYSQZfIFs81q8Bq-LU?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/0p3eSrWABWgECt-3QqNgUBSGh7x4GC5F7u2L-nzhgracuclfrfcv063bKNaaDBfwegwi0LdxUKKc81qnW1cDUXo7WFNTZV5xF1xgjFimTPWyBChPF9bJQwuRQRC9v-B4fM8RMtovEzo_wQfpRLpn9N0LZV1xZRsQ0x1VfEQeXtiIZ06Ko3nw9SACfguvIhWc?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div><p>If this is your first time visiting <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> , you may be wondering where to go, what to eat, where to stay, and how to get around to fully enjoy your vacation. With its blue sea, beautiful islands, rich cuisine, and many exciting activities, Vũng Tàu is always an ideal destination for every traveler.</p><p>Below are some useful tips to make your first trip easier and more memorable.</p><h2>☀️ Choose the Right Time to Visit</h2><p>The weather in Vũng Tàu is quite mild and can be visited almost year-round.</p><p>However, the best time is usually from <strong>March to August</strong> – when the sun shines beautifully, the sea is calm, and it is very favorable for outdoor activities such as swimming, island tours, or diving.</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/0kPF7sxBgLD_ehpNgC-84rUQl3U9KTHQMJPyBShLKK7unjWU2GvnKv17vfGmI_kRkmX93qUYSjomQXFMOcdpxcQ1h_p8hAdF4HVYXuMlxKXqdWN5wQG0eIH85TkcNCEc7Jsn-DncNZwPYWObGVtbKHr5uR1-K-QyUz9EOJDSlI4?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/HQcfGY86FJWoBwmxexMS6KKSGYwl5Th5EQpwTL7J6uIeDIy5Q02dIEB-4Ytn96WDSEnRHV6XtyUiTV-uGhWlnXuNpGEK0xA61FoYvMgdrrhWMWok6Rh_B4-XHqUFumxOoI3f2A7FyKu8C-dI03o8l94qc445tHdcTZeuRgpsEAhF8rp6Igu3OHQBz6gJtPfz?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>If you prefer a quieter relaxation experience, you may choose the period from September to November when there are fewer tourists.</p><h2>✈️ How to Get to Vũng Tàu</h2><p>Travelers often arrive in Vũng Tàu by plane, landing at <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Long Thành International Airport</span> .</p><p>It takes about 40–50 minutes by taxi, private car, or airport bus to get from the airport to the city center.</p><p>If you want more convenience and privacy, you can book a transfer service from the hotel.</p><h2>🏨 Choose the Right Hotel</h2><p>If you enjoy premium relaxation with beautiful sea views, prioritize hotels along the coastline or in the quieter northern area.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/img-0974-1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_0974-1\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Ruby 68 Hotel is the ideal choice with an infinity pool, rooms with sea-view balconies, a rooftop bar, and a convenient location to explore the city.</p><h2>🏝️ Must-Visit Places</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Kh1YqDyJp8XOZlzxwUBBLE3fJcN1kCVwCqUj7TK8aAbPYqp63EjzP_quwi9sxeYNVFo-F2cWedBx4u9AT7Swcn0J8TTW_NotNwuGU4oTqCVIxKUdxXPrMAU2NcdrS69e91XUfdxMrrq1X9siweWSNHmprJVfaQYgTGFIfDfkR_a2OoRgFZrUezRqOYORgNmv?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/C2x0HmwsMr_orYMwaABZ9POooGIkMHGcXo0Z0F5mPF-p5sdarRuOpeHMdVGdVrmeB6Ke0HTXKQKKeOdjvqgFjHEcrHJ-0R1FQtsBb08XgCWCYulJ3sw2gURLRUT8kOcJrWJqT7xvCRVm7OJKJvxRtTPA7dlC60hem5_o2pQlmIjC2a7uGR4_h4BrAJ1FHf-W?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>Here are some highlights you should visit:</p></div><ul><li><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Mun Island</span> – a diving paradise</li><li><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Hon Chong</span> – a famous natural landscape</li><li><p><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Long Son Pagoda</span> – a renowned spiritual destination</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/cLpVSaOTSn7zmwzhYpkjjZlOYY3PnJimR4R4cuuu7h611YIGi6iVvIlqmy5EbbQkZ2ZuVMmVMVtS4akgSoorPA8E4GuzhWYlKzzJ_Wh_5wYZlwGDa7QbRZM2XhrwysHBUh5yNs8K5C8Fa9hRHWKijtGRnonjLEEtLmxUtozanhs?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/TCKVCfSE4Bt6xSFdD6x8_lV-CAoy12hxOQ28HpoezTgFQouCHmW2yDl3aQj8DLjfLQfygkiRg5vwlyzkhi97nBPVCy07bT7LsDeCZXfVnEYCtnM9IubcDblDMSVzHyOvLVKQHZQybeAzpKyUrZsCQhsCO2BPzTiXX-xb4uDmbhkZsM46T1V0EwHSaizCPC0F?purpose=fullsize\"></div></li><li><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu Stone Church</span> – a European corner in the heart of the city</li><li><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu Night Market</span> – explore local cuisine and evening shopping</li></ul><h2>🍤 Don&#039;t Miss Local Cuisine</h2><p>Vũng Tàu is famous for its signature dishes such as:</p><ul><li>Fresh seafood</li><li>Vũng Tàu fish noodle soup</li><li>Vũng Tàu grilled spring rolls</li><li>Banh Can</li><li>Banh Canh with fish cake</li></ul><p>A trip would not be complete without exploring the seafood cuisine here.</p><h2>🎒 A Few Small Tips</h2><ul><li>Bring sunscreen, sunglasses, and swimwear</li><li>If going on an island tour, wear comfortable shoes and bring a waterproof bag</li><li>It&#039;s advisable to book hotels and tours in advance during peak season</li><li>Always check the weather before going to the beach or diving</li></ul><h2>✨ Enjoy Vũng Tàu Your Way</h2><p>Vũng Tàu is suitable for all types of travel: relaxation, exploration, family, or couples.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:696/374;\" src=\"https://puolotrip.com/uploads/images/2023/09/Bien-nha-trang-3-jpg.webp\" alt=\"Vũng Tàu Beach Tourism - The Beautiful Beaches of Ba Ria - Vung Tau Province\" width=\"696\" height=\"374\"></figure><p>You can start your day with a sunrise at the beach, spend the afternoon exploring islands, and end with cocktails at the rooftop while watching the sunset.</p><p><strong>Your first visit to Vũng Tàu will be easier with good preparation – and even more wonderful when you&#039;re ready to savor every moment in this beautiful coastal city.</strong></p></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\">&nbsp;</div>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578683010236-d716f9a3f461?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80'),
('en_US', 59, 'Experience the Thrills at Hồ Mây Park Vũng Tàu', 'Discover the ultimate entertainment paradise amidst the stunning bay', '<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p>&nbsp;</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/dSOKkGeH6J0W558X1XG-rC5nuNPwqeLRHUkFVRmsC8znd5mth41pHvPofgtuiceruv11G_w7ZrdSLkOkOYYjeI77n54LjIqPgBYgD5S5wIW3tPhi2W7ZRE1LgY8Ct6Uhd0p2cCSZh23tbbpvl83z2rgdG4yKADOKSBm9Ih7wMWM?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/xyzJoxrpiSQM-bcej0p5ISrAyE--6T0G2QVhJWDP8AyAlNhZh90SdUctdPYQpQGeVrY1EmityQTQQ5lyGgukz27hutCi7jOsnRvD5badeYkzsTABNRV_9NJLPh0jB6Wfyv1lwo3KuV_5h9wq7hVF5XnJhKz5uTmZE-2b4nQ7gK75lUD0WV2m23rb0W9ECfkR?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><p><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Hồ Mây Park Vũng Tàu</span> is one of the most renowned amusement destinations in <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> , attracting millions of visitors each year. Located on Hon Tre Island, Hồ Mây Park offers a grand entertainment complex with a water park, thrilling rides, an aquarium, shows, and many captivating experiences for all ages.</p><p>If this is your first visit, the following tips will help you fully enjoy a day of fun here.</p><h2>🚠 Arrive Early to Maximize Your Experience</h2><p>A single day at Hồ Mây Park is often not enough if you wish to explore the entire amusement park.</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/rsR0dLs6UX8xUathILqBwBhgh8vSnDoIm08JFaGn_ehtjDbP0tqZwi-taRepZ-npUBtjf7Ho6iGjn_crvYIdijvu2MHjOYoWkY89NQQcmBdvLBKyOnoH_cmDM7tD6Qh34L31QxlHzE1736dcX4kQv29G5Cd8qgQ5WujAYWWaSSw?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/UOBwYUiPw8X3Dgk12vG9dDUiSL71tbR8MRY3WhazAMhZRxPsFWgvKoUikn4HbI9EuoMMNaYmQv06-gHT5IOE-ALuTU53kGrawN-rn0XIxfG15DqCOfX0tb0RzXuBtDweMpSrFzuwTYuBnpjVolcuxDdt7iWLAMBzWyJIW6ZXq-C2qZF03-88Oyj5HdNKZsZl?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>Arrive early in the morning to make the most of your time and avoid long queues at popular attractions. You&#039;ll also have the chance to experience the sea-crossing cable car or speedboat in the best weather.</p><h2>🎢 Prioritize Suitable Amusement Areas</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/qKOcmVp-9kj6uX1PwNW0n0JLydCpmNKBq0KCsKCRmxNCyDW6rDrpqdzJURlxTYfvK959h1Dn0vYLeDtP_CJMvvYvJSir7U5PR5m_Y-3o8_GTjfOnue-ji460UXTkBr92aALBVG3GA6CCMVq_m4VPZexl-pJ1xB7Ffvo_pjOGP6A?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/U3e3bh6cCZKvvCGettnjIucuqPAhe50fAjZEgc4w9YzTDQbMT4w6zP0IfgUf9fiWriK1Ji_3vrbqb4typeIhnsL8wgskVCQh3B2Ui0O90NnFn6qW3o2jruGVZHH0coKqWlY17ZWH1-G2S4qYTdwsV3q041AI7_fR_6LNx9tJOAp5TUkyvBDVln_1tLq7j-kK?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><p>Hồ Mây Park features many enticing zones:</p><ul><li><strong>Adventure Land:</strong> thrilling rides for speed enthusiasts</li><li><strong>Water World:</strong> refreshing water park</li><li><p><strong>Sea World:</strong> aquarium and marine animal shows</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/XREFiuqxTihDRr4vcosyBJTodPo3kz81SzFWeH1z-7OhIzWXdXOARPf5D8_igrAuElnWo6oOGDqilHccenc_QEhVvQu6IA3wG_hyOwz1TuDQnfbgR2C3kl89c3p8gj_PHzPdGp6TIp_82LEEdC0cEHIaH5hYagoqmnMurZ8AS-U?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/fO3sDZJ2kqGRxLW7sTXB8gbBHwlASTReJ65aNoUaYyQ_Ejm7xXUBmf4hQsFH-OfOHDG2Dc5XTAEx9Q2RIswWuIcSztPiBQq3U772Yne_JEj6tBjNW3fSzSnVVF-Zo9MdbFeRR0bXE6Q3o2MP50hdc5toDOIWwqy6I3b_vuKtbOObR5KKGaH0t9kOwEd4BmGe?purpose=fullsize\"></div></li><li><strong>Fairy Land / King’s Garden:</strong> ideal for children and families</li><li><p><strong>Tata Show:</strong> a spectacular evening performance</p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/iJyggywmKZlgxaXqZmF5DUAraCgZVURoZGuSDkwUSlr415Stv4H4xk0R0J8IwlGVSPeJumwB2pTM0PX4XYVtCOUmAyb2qDH2gqwimjpuaHTaKClcenR97YO-U2Hj6CZ6y_A266ebD1E-v9MP2HgyUWX8L6Y653GLE8_65H6y1QA?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/A68uzsfegkrMXK1E9TspiVXwVq3xuH0XAs19hSZohYg2gxDwl-Xlz4fDmdLWt-UaznEggiestdnzSbDDXKGRhNx1BniDpGXeadCNi4mtbad42uCOwDXDVOc8rhfRWAZx6H3aJrMbFBmTDTrkk3JJSkQHALiBTWs2UgvLBIUJgPmf3bm-4WFkBE9cbM0PpwSb?purpose=fullsize\"></div></li></ul><p>If you&#039;re with a family with young children, prioritize the gentler areas first. If you love thrills, enjoy the “hot” rides right at the start of the day.</p><h2>👕 Prepare Appropriate Gear</h2><p>For a more comfortable trip, you should prepare:</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:900/600;\" src=\"https://statics.ho-may-park.com/vw%202_1714713525.jpg\" alt=\"What Exciting Experiences Does Hồ Mây Park Vũng Tàu Offer?\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\"></figure><ul><li>Swimwear if visiting the water park</li><li>Comfortable clothing, easy-to-move footwear</li><li>Sunscreen, sunglasses, hat</li><li>Waterproof bag for your phone</li></ul><p>The weather in Vũng Tàu is quite sunny, so being well-prepared will allow you to enjoy longer while staying comfortable.</p><h2>🍔 Plan Your Meal Times Wisely</h2><p>Hồ Mây Park has many restaurants and food stalls within the premises.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:2048/1366;\" src=\"https://tranivietnam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/gioi-thieu-vinwonders-nha-trang.jpg\" alt=\"30-Day Validity] Hồ Mây Park Vũng Tàu Entrance Ticket (Round-Trip Cable Car Option) - Trani Vietnam\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1366\"></figure><p>It&#039;s advisable to have lunch early or later than peak hours to avoid crowds. You can take a break in the middle of the day before continuing your fun in the afternoon.</p><h2>🌅 Stay Until Evening for Shows and Scenery</h2><p>Many visitors leave early and miss out on the most beautiful experiences in the evening.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:900/480;\" src=\"https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/2a/92/b5/fb/khu-ph-thuong-m-i-hon.jpg?w=900&amp;h=500&amp;s=1\" alt=\"Hồ Mây Park Vũng Tàu (Vietnam) - Reviews - Tripadvisor\" width=\"900\" height=\"480\"></figure><p>As the city lights up, Hồ Mây Park becomes more dazzling with light shows, music, and especially the Tata Show – one of the most beloved performances.</p><p>The sunset on Hon Tre Island is also very beautiful and worth capturing with impressive photos.</p><h2>✨ Complete Your Retreat at Ruby 68</h2><p>After a long day exploring Hồ Mây Park, returning to a comfortable retreat space is essential.</p><p>Ruby 68 Hotel is the ideal choice with an infinity pool, relaxing spa, and luxurious rooms – where you can recharge for your next journey.</p><p><strong>Hồ Mây Park Vũng Tàu is not just an amusement park, but a complete entertainment journey for families, couples, and groups of friends in the beautiful coastal city.</strong></p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618773928121-c32242e63f39?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80');
INSERT INTO `posts_translations` (`lang_code`, `posts_id`, `name`, `description`, `content`, `image`) VALUES
('en_US', 60, 'Top 7 Fun Places for Children in Vũng Tàu', 'Suggestions for exciting family destinations in the coastal city', '<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/mg15HCN_aJruR-hhb2VwFxHedJS75HD1_kUFFggPpeBgnVM78HYyDmiCQwu6U5SxPrd5rgjqPUCwuF52IWXNNgyGv14woSK80ts_o3hkLYzCUOApTGcPacv9EUHPL6pSG0FfEY5j9euNgxsNmIgWrxqpGo4iilixANRYWmDowaw?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Ycfy1kROfjZO_967ITr-XjJrHiDy9kBexvJkRNkuoPr60RP39aO5UvpcBkHJUlStecIinRS2sSgXWZgmYrH9zxvCiCnsSDVEY4_v_MAUqbF7S0ZFp2wEbq-3T5Tqkdfp9lFx_OR5YtRyF9AhaMT_ZU9TuztCLd0xqrQ1j-bIdzbozYFx5scromm0G-OxbEG7?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> is not only a paradise for adults but also a wonderful destination for families with young children. From amusement parks and aquariums to beaches and indoor play areas, this coastal city offers a plethora of exciting experiences for children to play and explore.</p><p>Here are 7 fun places for children in Vũng Tàu that your family should not miss.</p><h2>🎡 1. <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Hồ Mây Park Vũng Tàu</span> – An entertainment paradise for all ages</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/J2qxQylllNHgDEsqiIhLbITNIOeCTD2Ex2d9LTcmvw00v6nDXTScAS74lSPZL4FM03npSxttvSzXcbLl_E_0i38rwoSQxiuNLvutfxKONc0a-2DAAMQx3srQ_qSHtW-2FTXo-9prvVFc0FlNzIWTvhILSAnnty6Nj1kCu5z44R4?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Xn4xNuSv_fbeMy4k9OCC_DJhEMrsIU5tjoTAO9pZZzoKBKNhGoJKVy9sOESaITM6cpl57rqaoSYdoYzDMw1r-J8tmphjMQWfmeoZLmkYDODjbu-V2-47xpe803pb0skOYQIRB_viXQaDJC3KyVAxqQK_6qIrFMV7TBVDBeRGcXb2kd1RNswyuQ2-5FXZNz9A?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p>Hồ Mây Park features a variety of play areas for children, including an aquarium, water park, family games, and a fairy tale zone.</p><p>This is the ideal choice for a full day of fun.</p><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/4fJIGIbgrPwa46PxFGeYs42vP6b6Q3PMqeAjfosgIDfRHxi1IcfLfJBKJTKVFnn4MNUfCpB0QQP9XZvbx3XunbdAnXw-xQuJfPQMW8tw-h-QiDX3DW-jXf3xiynvBo6XgOvpL0602NthYkyolqSobXvqge-okXUP778fC18F3PU?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/YpENKfAiawvMrBhrXOjyFeYgIejIzdNkYS_BGyUAxKfHm1Q3ZD75_wRBflf1ADVVMF1su1iBAWgTlvr7pujs9LcaBBd-0J0MK66zfEeAvrc4ZGAV9OYetxxD045TPKdipwOueMWh30U_7LEFrzk7iX3FuFlynj0y15F8Q2tiQnZ0yqrsL_RUvuC0ADBZmLC8?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>🐠 2. <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu Oceanography Institute</span> – Explore the ocean world</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/3e2PZECk15AV-VuAn0-IWVJyZ7fQDxDvviJ8FaTY3BtZcinv6vrBTTeT0YCEY6wdYGT6sqjtX4OzgzPeSFDEb1CAcpGiZOre4WvVBv4G8ACeSnn6w78yPErbiuh8-YgG0bDkLLc6ieVwbD-IAgcZQ_juEi6ViVshIF2mYuotxnE?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/RCao3jNWpW1K6VlRjetM6-7oDQeCPXgmIoe4sybR7UJvp_wZ2NNs99GIV3FHVxOWfa_1nBZjE0OupZ3KlvzNvaNcS7_J5jphGKUxXda3YBLdbeS6gDkWFFqhUa4XD8J81zqKSqmyle17FX5kT-UhWbwO2KzcdstSJO2DJwXjTnUsE7TH-3frMb4UAYzH43V-?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><p>Children will have the opportunity to see hundreds of marine species, whale skeleton models, and many fascinating exhibits.</p><p>Learning while playing is a wonderful experience here.</p><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/zMjtibKh9-FE3Bt7pqrFY491w-dZA5dezAhv0Ud0KkPFC1wvXU-yqJCa7CzNSHBuX3qqrBhsz1oF8EMV_YMzT1lwTq6oLmnzgJHba_HQqIfiDQhdwf-C6vt6BulFmi_qeIMhZGuICcKqNofCQaeV6Lmz3QO1nmirVX1xZdi9uJE?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/HJTvNeN6zK-Gl9O1rLHRnfp-E1MCN8yOOOOuFiccwWmABaItj8FBxCCyUb_ndC6T8xY-gRs7yVBMVCsPv7fLjgpCOl0rADcrRybORBdfdCb1XVdHuhExOoi4T4vFJOw9FFwsgHg8uk4h84hZPhHfXR2lRdO_IERymN9Jyjht9Hgj_4PxpcOVwMNcN1YwrBEk?purpose=fullsize\"></div><hr><h2>🐒 3. <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Monkey Island</span> – Meet mischievous friends</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/-b1-Mr6Ix4pPmiaPZfyvA9C3fVRJLl-rJ089cxC-SXt112dM3azkwwruiu-Q_H5J3OjnRYCIo0fIPua9ZEPPUN_vI5EAw3bwBPKZ5Ok89M-DcD9YPEY9TzawHWqzQuKRUpWM7eT0GQGWjQpW1M4hdyja0dq7JApHuIKUUNvVnF0?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/_XZwPnquD1aMuxSyl1SRwazu6R-hWeccB1DglwIkWl_YYRD_LeWCnON8oadf3ElPI2U4kYrNZFuWI504VpzRzXDLq-zZ0Tv4J89yo4mQi_sNmjbWx4oW_0dxj6m-GIqRYAQg5F5RuboJyIYd08t6fGlfF1hERHg0_EUZdG4sFq1Ujmd5IVkHKrT9aO4UJk0d?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">Children often delight in meeting and playing with playful monkeys in their natural environment.</div></div></div><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/JRgcCXLPM-eiQdlVLb6suOQMcSJnBdnLeaxYpWMjglM-Dy6FRqHDNTQknN1z3gckqjDkjvqCGmMqaECrCtA5oGsgQDT10yD2T9NzrWypZaLA4IlLgOnq1XDWLOxaXk9iB9Ce0FWYZNmPhCv7YGnzXwHpHTzEg2dyuC5KH2hhgRs?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/SgRuHmC5RKBo4M9ZjO9d0LrblOoCRH2fJaBu_F22LPAV_DmSmeFRluh3iRILDctxymdZevtnBT2CWrhIlF90oirCXQg7uS4fRV19gdqPXojZiCD-iDlhP6si4IApGrO6zhnn604NmM4VOAZxvLn64tvzpG5ZemF3kyGUNhrwdpX3bOG4ExYgv0MjbNE_prab?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>🏖️ 4. Tran Phu Beach – Fun on the sand and sea</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/8yIjjqEm6HsTYGDSEvcg2qJ4t8_e1ugNX_A8Ehacio3qQqnUjwbtd-1_cw18rhXAjhKDBvmM-ltbYrPDm8CEHCePhj_zTet30jvaWyZAxzYrBAF3sxNnKl3FiIDiTThbahWTeh6h1JjKnMWpbdh2L6rD55Bz7YH5KO8BO5kWz-k?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/8CjzfIgGIYKF8fbHPoV6kYECz0faRHF1Ezy_jUxHa_Olrcki5UwH2bjiQVbfsSXBvOIh_sm8QOs76qp0JlU6UPbZY0gBIR292oB-RPLOK0M5yjI8nTHvZ_XNbl4fq1dJxt9HZwS4J7TStjd_mMPW34N2u6wpO0dnjL_Vlq3nEis-OCc2VGzlB_hJy6H-KaZc?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/5AiwvLNSg-8ZaT2pIWQjsDvtBbIB1XvNS4JOWkc9ne5aC08W1CGhATuo_6tk450VQS_W_r99IKmHcHnYpqum2Ch516Jj96KzeDG6iSHAj_IfCo_UkgH0tUukQClYH0nmdvduppo2pHM4bBzz0EnlWn02pi8VR9hppRmA-bz7GeI?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/6pMXW2EZ88a5OlV0XsFPHL7FYkb0zmBDjDNPJi0bZrwlxSlfVK8Wis0P1avS5rv8cvdihSpG_h3MauzFQo9N7HFqfyb89rr5v5W306Dy_c3LS5XN_THcEn-dUAzlWL8LBDg9W8TnfNx_1KZ8nO2nI8VMd1g7ebqss8m0UaH98_p3uMvVCxIQlKKy0KxWQQOl?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The central beach with gentle waves is the perfect place for children to play in the sand, swim, and engage in outdoor activities.</p><h2>🛝 5. Indoor Play Area</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/MFKatVIF2KAU15iRcRxTJAZzzUrzuZpXIFGeo-C8Bzg4Wfd-V9OJb_Q_NjUkvfI5hCZGtTt40SjlmFRc_Cf5GrlSbMgRAIzVunxtmobyr2mHRePu9NK54L3Ox3F0uH9JMso0_uuETyhNiEiKdRJQRJpnnCmf1HPhEssF3IAELRU?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/zRL46Y2G-Og8MyaYHoUBuz-JrxS1AzljKgSaVFmIGLV2AjcGVlPYpLBUYZSTHFAcV0VRhUwzzxqy3i9-CpULRQMyHPon8JUow61rNuszf2cWsbzn8wkld3szouUdQFxoeM2nlnFIE3-G9dS-Xkg5hRB7A-GNrWl79UL2_KcsrASn7wUW2W19CsmYS1OLNBuR?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/rR3G0ZaArrGwAwbPdwt83n3SfZtUPSkI2bVEMtmrSe2RERNWSWBr8UGGeoEurI5LLGI558s5zui5yHgK2bTbipIQI5d0G4uepLveW6jsWXFothsPtcP1R8uJ9b4kjzTK21NzSFPBB6uE6yJqHs3-aVkuCwH4ba-5X0M8GVQZo0Q?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ohi8EMf1EbJlkuCVxQEtQ9PBwdABQSSLwyJdLGYksqP9pcBd0XKDLtVIs9gdMAesrLwkysGNHfe28xFzundQ3v7bbp91t_gr4gsh0IppSGNjYDbFtIqZA-BGMgxmOvQllU1WEgNpm38sjAyq3yUcsUXsZZJNM_ZCDMsgv_ze1w3hA3GGHsRfmdfpqxhKHY-I?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p>On hot sunny days or rainy days, the indoor play area is a safe and convenient choice.</p><h2>🚤 6. Gentle Island Tours for Families</h2><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/mGwefpa2yNGEdLQAUhRa3q4N2mbnlR3YYcOntPXVoZ2RYDJ4-_YSVna4qWO1XPc3_VEb1jeV-iX-7lDmFl20oCFdAwpVdaq8bxMXDeLgxJZeneb_ecNaBfOUmeL943PfP36BRO-gbxQg7tp-UAYcyeYQt4koAPDlii8p7Ygo1tM?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/nEa8Dld9_65OHfbbfKQWtSAyxV9mxQzhGdLbyYfBK5Ui7kwMkVZgBxTLww7OuJerPg9WA4wnhTx79OP44GYnywek5Ey0nZAMZ80QLqtMn-rtLvoMCVuP12yzT5iOYluL5dsbQEgcBYTeOu7Bx5MXSY5TV40r-lq560IvO6z35nVEDDsmf7dAALX7obB_ql68?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>Short island tours with minimal travel are suitable for young children while still providing many exciting experiences.</p><div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\"><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-d