('en_US', 61, 'Top 10 Free Tourist Attractions in Vũng Tàu', 'Discover the beauty of the coastal city at no cost.', '<p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/iBBylwTds5wrJP6b3uwTCjYMEh2x6rRfJRzANQ_Hba68S59b199lblefRxKhmrqrJ4A0vGnxVY4cHSP4ENIB0nTM4ctfv5hHOh5kxt9Sgj_yDJ_YteF3SROaTjHK6DSQLvykcFWDgxhUpKtVhcOZdnNrSC3LYO2ZZgaSPW6Dv4k?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/9dBKBHwiPYShShDTJua65EsEmB87WLMFoiqaEKy2zPW2U31K_mcpd23EY0FjeTkNZzmBOuXgPCLF3qiYZ2OVyt_-eAU1nldSnFHYy6gugksDKJ1ktxBB5v7hZuc2bSAKfDDNt8ib38PbrSr3D1n_NjIC-lEDnjbrBHlHFRPkEo1N4yLEbR57eXdYi4UW0FIR?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> is not only renowned for its luxurious resorts but also boasts numerous free attractions where you can fully enjoy the beauty of the sea, culture, and the local rhythm of life.</p><p>Below are 10 places you can explore completely free when visiting Vũng Tàu.</p><h2>🌊 1. Tran Phu Beach – The city&#039;s Icon</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/vw86Y-7Qe3ENXW-aMlqu8t-DFx3tDm78APE7vU3ryDCphmTpn55LYe9ScJiihziiHlHw8digsYHDRyf2grwb6PJnCEOzuxba0-E4qAN_5v_KzV4WZjVnRQTUXvrePtsmPmFZ5lnfnUVyfXYMsjsOi-iwGrczgelqNItpIWB4aGHN18QxAtj5G1pqxV6KvpuG?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/zK-qpkf_0QWnXF_iGwSSToH514ktxkpG2RpCSl2pOFlBQDdHCf3F6wA9X_VWw2k0JMjYZEMgct8_TMVhE8hQAAoCPGfMfPNJp8irfWJt7Jrka-sXnYQP7vVXvTSozk0KyXpKzuoTDWIG_bsJxGTptSMw0XxcbH-en7YDa7YyW3HGuv3Cm_1tY2jJRILLSxbs?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p>A long beach right in the center, where you can swim, stroll, or watch the sunrise – completely free.</p><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Ai-aQg4jaBuH1lyQwUaD2zrVSkiMwg_kPEjQ3n8XInoyGzA4yyhEhS79oLTYtC1X_EM9CJXrGA7UufPzAFmnrN7j8o5Eyw6vJoK09BhYa5LbvW86AvBOb2wVS_JwqOEus-GxPsoUeFga3KYVe0EPzowPzbbz8dznsTx2dRJSs2Q?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/Hbyyvq9J_cGY4pWnZ3r3wa5YuTtlueqjOiyReCe9UJHP78OXygUiVzGdN9vS_veWsQN2tF5FO6EbcvOq9pIuAkkq9hcqpoVDcA67fJgtkp9-50G8SHM5s8WE7uq_s8RzcUrL44Z7fwAMKq4AJ-CtJTRapUI01Zf78B5H-kA-HTUCkK4q1wHo4YOiQfNhQgTO?purpose=fullsize\"></div><h2>🪨 2. <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Hon Chong</span> – Unique rock formations</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></b