4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/E2q1y5Rebwf7GjFJ5z0R9cWcatG19Vx9RF2V4Kpfxw4d_kZYjUwDracWK66ZyLqA0GHKJ5fbu5zwOOUKIgm99Yzi7AUfHUTXGgwFzX3AuILb2modWC1LqHmFlbU3rkXmeKI27CViveoj07PWvp7xYVpMH5E7htFpuvQyM_2npj0?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/IpW9phzFf63edpRc3uzTtWfS5Tk3nloCjcjCzdUOI9kv7ox73Usz-GfSCJMeyMvXWBy0xJaM6u056p5MwZZ632tViBYls9Hp_qN4YYr1OJb56j-wpLNX-Fs5cELUT9bSZdx4e7pSjXxm8TnWvKJ5sIS0zRp2zpiNJB3iFQSnEXJy5_ILCrU8RlK4aKsP8xnT?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div></div><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/i1SyZJp-VMHEzDgsgPwIngrDKcyaDoRzS_TgNZ7viBSEFJozcwIUkkupkeM3ed80oD8yf8lHTAJ9OMJvLicf_bJEoK_l22Y2YSrpw7NS_t4WdjokKE5ZVWfTFXB1XVxj-ekSpooR3xUZYbgTV2WrOV3aQPLSLxEOswZUdcXRpDw?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/ACnl8wcF-2Y5tLwn0kIRcoRgjLw8AAgGDBtMp8crZ7-_snHzCicO9Gu3eM8m1pNBQLAnhUd9NvcOAqxyyEjGOwJ-CTZJaCC4eWv-kXee-dyIby5tBQEsz3KEcb9KM8LcVyMCVg9E1iISj_CVDZuWwDG5_p46PX-q8UhAYGZnumjoLGwrSaJdpbv5AqF1bemv?purpose=fullsize\"></div><p>One of the most beautiful and tranquil beaches, ideal for relaxation.</p><h2>🛍️ 9. Local Markets (Dam Market, Xom Moi Market)</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/_pV3cOraufRIQYlwUB5tuufHcr50CMxr5cCn8K1IVkSYZtOe4EXqyrmu8BubIfyMf87QWgIVbk9HriYwR7Tp-0izZNLoCC-PIvx3oU2oE0gYMDjsM0b6r6U3j09RP_kQ5Ilg_9MT66nHU2c6TW229FSOLSgR8p-lfFaFSezcZUI?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/6yqiDkEThxWzw3rtOnKBwS7wKvkPTerQv2Pvr-MVUk86-Z8w9j_0bje_7L0Kk15nxupqVwhgE-sSKI1uyA2KiN2213SLtYVgvNeORc7LQBBDSJnjNiq-yqOCH0e4-TGTgB4Kz4jsZwnWRtoTrXna2_sVvyfIS2ucPMTdt68OxJrcJqFNsxiwXcNJZd30etLs?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><p>You can visit and learn about local culture without spending a dime.</p><h2>🌅 10. Beach Walk &amp; Sunrise – Sunset</h2><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\"><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/pI89M3414ucORPTU1uXNsDxG6F9a5MQWKPPxzQD0zQiZvm7lm6RTv-SN4sWFlHlA-zwn6p-53usl91IuCoNb-jdcCiychBy6Uddm1sTs87C08LQH-gISvP0k8rfARlNm9TEmLIZm2dNVrIZ3jQ2aDQbkNkRDqq2gYbJA62-z3UeFyqp076srGpmDYbvGcwby?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/MY24Wns_ZdKkWyM29QkrI3IA0boVje_hQ1Bvm8r4CLL_rscFf6rV9ZN8e0kQG5zXVUTmTcBHnGh5r1B4l8Nhe1Bw0cWm2IFj8nJzcXKyo-MaosfsBsAVqV5gaNcwm3ZQIM8F1qy-ZGtJI4L0NXX9jTCiG2PJkDT02shjO5R67e479NCDaKSTcHHfWVi9n9wa?purpose=fullsize\"></div></div></div><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\"><div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><p>One of the most beautiful experiences – completely free yet full of emotions.</p><h2>✨ Smart Experience – Complete Relaxation</h2><p>Even when choosing free attractions, you can still combine it with a luxurious stay at Ruby 68 Hotel to enjoy comfort, privacy, and 3-star service.</p><p><strong>Vũng Tàu is not just for lavish vacations – it is also a destination where you can fully appreciate beauty in the simplest and most refined way.</strong></p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590073242678-70ee3fc28e8e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=927&q=80');
