iner/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><p><button class=\"h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]\"></button></p><div><img class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/xzjlIL_0Md3MndrgfuI9PNUnX9ZgAXNQQ20SY6zVLH1bMADpU7S2jAvc0jg-WBGNWHzVQk1fmVnQtod0-8tOKIfTkVk3bzAXNxPwBlXUi9n-ah0lW6mL4dkkU44fCy91XFvnBMIbt-4kdYSZ71eIhbSJBQpE_Evc0olTZkWTOKM?purpose=inline\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/LAPt2ljg97GpzFPd82TxsFp9KMKtMNRrMBvt_D_4GQ8WjuQ_F22msHbEQsP2mewUBRP9GhGJWrQUWwQp45LL3e3W2PocGaOosKrgL54b3-gOGCj9G5mF5HuVg1fQyP3_0UTX7EqrK6laxa8NmQxrydcz6qxrzCOziT5l4bRFTiwiex9xwrlbjtMOnKRx30YI?purpose=fullsize\"></div><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><p>In addition to famous landmarks such as Tran Phu Beach or <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Hồ Mây Park Vũng Tàu</span> , <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-normal\">Vũng Tàu</span> there are still many pristine and lesser-known beautiful spots. These are ideal places for travelers who love exploration, seeking unique experiences and more tranquil moments.</p><p>Below are some “hidden gems” you should try during your trip to Vũng Tàu.</p><h2>🌿 1. <span class=\"hover:e