(7, 'Botble\\Blog\\Models\\Post', 1, 1, 'description', 'Discover a world of unique comfort in our collection of 8 double rooms, each boasting its own distinct charm and character. Immerse yourself in a stay that caters to your individual preferences', 'On the evening of February 4, the entire Ruby 68 Hotel family came together for a warm and memorable year-end celebration held at the Ruby Lobby on the 3rd floor of the hotel, with the presence of the Management Board and all team members.', '2026-03-16 03:05:37', '2026-03-16 03:05:37'),
