(11, 'Botble\\Blog\\Models\\Post', 2, 1, 'description', 'Delve into the secrets behind the music that resonates deeply with audiences worldwide. Uncover the essential qualities that elevate music from ordinary to extraordinary, as we explore.', 'Let us look back on the unforgettable moments of CHRISTMAS HARMONY NIGHT 2025 at Ruby 68 Hotel — an evening where sparkling lights, elegant melodies, and a warm festive atmosphere came together to create a truly enchanting Christmas celebration.', '2026-03-16 21:10:55', '2026-03-16 21:10:55'),
