(749, 'theme-riorelax-en_US-hotel_rules', '<ul><li>Check-in/Check-out: Check-in from 14:00 and check-out before 12:00.</li><li>Identification: Please present a valid Passport (for international guests) or ID/Citizen ID (for Vietnamese guests) upon check-in.</li><li>Payment Policy: Provide credit card details or a deposit to guarantee your reservation.</li><li>Complimentary Amenities: 02 bottles of water, tea, and coffee daily.</li><li>Wi-Fi: Complimentary high-speed internet access throughout the hotel.</li><li>Smoking: Smoking is not allowed in the room; please use the balcony or designated areas.</li><li>Pets: Pets are not permitted in the hotel to ensure hygiene standards.</li><li>Safety: Please use the in-room safe for valuables; the hotel provides 24/7 security.</li><li>Occupancy: Guests must stay according to the booked room capacity; surcharges apply for extra persons or children.</li><li>Prohibited Items: Strictly no explosives, weapons, or strong-smelling food in the room.</li></ul>', '2026-04-23 06:49:59', '2026-08-13 03:59:28'),
