('en_US', 49, 'Ruby 68 Vũng Tàu Hotel', '', 'Located next to the clear blue water of the bay, this is a symbolic destination of a vibrant and classy coastal city, promising to become an ideal resort for those who are looking for a dream vacation amidst peaceful nature. With a sophisticated, polite and considerate service style, along with a wealth of experience and international standards, we respectfully welcome you to Ruby 68 - the'),
